<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ikitabu i Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu i Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nayos</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikitabu i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uhoolhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo Itorati phi machokholhelho o malhehero anophwanyiya nhina ikitabu chikina nthanu chilhe. (Yaani ikitabu nthanu nhina Malhehano o Khalhai). Wo nuulhumo no Ieburaniya, nchina no ilha ikitabu ilha maana aya “Malhove”. Ashinna Musa phi norumelhelhiya wiira phi ayo aalhempe ikitabu yo Itorati, yaahikhalhe vanomalha aya, vanohimiachiya mwaha wo ukhwa waya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu inochokholha wo uimiacha wiira, “alha phi malhove ashinna Musa oolhumanche aya wa attu o Uisraeli.” Urumelhelhiya wiira asinna Musa phi lhepilhe ikitabu yo Itorati unoolhuyita moono venchi ni Malhehano o Naanano. Thoko chinoonia aya nhina ikitabu yo Mitheko cha Akarumiya nlhako wo 3:22-23 Napeturo vanohokolhelha aya ikitabu yo Itorati 18:15-18 ahimiaka wiira ari malhove a ashinna Musa. Ashinna Musa phi aalhempe ikitabu yo Itorati, vamoka ni ivitabu cho Uchokholha, Uthana, Alawi, ni Ihesabu iyaakha 1300 ama 1400 Hinaaya uyaria Kuristo. Ikitabu yo itorati yaalhepiye thoko nkaaya wa mwene mmoka ni imwene yaatawara awe, upangiyaka khalhai. Nkaaya wa Nlhuku ni attu o Uisraeli. Nlhuku aahaleha attu wiira nowaavaha ibarakha arumelhelhaka malhehero awe. Ni attu o Uisraeli vaahilhe aya urumelhelha malhehero a Nlhuku, ahotwarushiya. Yoyo phi mwaha uri nhina ikitabu yonkhaye ilha, nansho mikhora cho 27 ni 28 umindaka wo uhimiacha ibarakha ni ulhaviya waakhumelhenlhe wa attu o Uisraeli wo nlhatu wo urumelhelha ni uhirumelhelha waya. Makosho a attu o Uisraeli eemenlhe mipatta miilhi umiakoni ibarakha ni ulhaviya uwo voolhumachiya aya wo ukhuwelhiya uhimiechesha malhehano ayo. Chiri nhina: Nhina mikhora cho 1 mpaka wo 3 ashinna Musa anohimiacha mwaha waakhumelhenlhe ikatema attu o Uisraeli vaari aya munkwahani uthakoni. Mikhora cho 4 mpaka wo 26 unohimiya chittu chaathananiya ni malhehano a Nlhuku ni attu awe. Tho, mikhora cho 27 mpaka wo 30 attu o Uisraeli anohimiacha ibarakha ni ulhaviya wo ukhuwelhiya wooniha wiira malhehano ari o ukhulhuvelhiya. Wo umalhihera, ni mikhora cho 31 mpaka wo 34 ashinna Musa anoohimiacha malhove o umalhihera u Nayoshua, ni wo kila nikosho na attu o Uisraeli, ahinaaya ukhwa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku nowaalhehera Nayoshua ukottolha Ukanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Baada yo urimeelha wa ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoolhumana Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni, akaaviha a ashinna Musa, yeeraka <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />Karumiya aka Musa hokhwa, vanova nlhapuwacheke mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, inyuva vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye mpaka ilhapo inoovahakani ilhe. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Kila vakittu vanohalha inyu unyikalha kihoovahani thoko chaalhehilhe aka ashinna Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Miinano cho ilhapo inyu inaakhalheke cho, uchawa ithakhwa, uchulhu miako cho Lebanoni, unoosha nchuwa ulhe mwoolhoko muulhupalhe wo Uyufrati ulhe, uvirelha ilhapo yonkhaye ya attu o Uhiti mpaka ibahari yo Umediteraniya mpata uneelha nchuwa. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Khaawo ntu nohalha ukottolhani mahuku onkhaye o ukumi inyu. Kinookhalha vamoka ni inyu thoko chaari aka ni ashinna Musa, mahuku onkhaye, wala akiinoohiyani mena. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Mwiilhipiheke ni uminda, ukhalhawaya inyuva nnowaholhelhiha alha attu alha akushe ikhalhe yawaya, ilhapo yaalhehilhe aka ashulhupalhe aya wiira kinowaavaha. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Nansho mwiilhipiheke ni uminda, nkhalheke rata ni owiinanelha ikekhiaye yonkhaye yoolhehenre aya ni akarumiya aka ashinna Musa. Nttwareke yeyo kila vakittu nhina wo yeyo ikekhiaye iyo, ni inyu nnooshichira variyoothe vanokelhelha inyu. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Mmweheke wiira khannolhiyalha mena ilha ikitabu yo Malhehero ilha, nansho mwiittucheke yeyo kila nihuku, uthana ni uhiyu wiira mwoorie uphanga onkhaye alhepiye mu, ni inyu nnooshichira ni ukonda variwoothe vahokelhelha inyu. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Muupuwelheke wiira, miyaano kihoolheherani mwiilhipiheke ni ukonda. Nhoove wala nhithulhuwe mmakhuvani ukhalhawaya miyaano Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, kirii vamoka ni inyu variwoothe vanokelhelha inyu.<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayoshua anowaalhehera attu ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Yamalheke Nayoshua nkayaalhehera ahoolhelhi a attu wiira, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />avireke nipuro ni waalhehera attu wiira, “Nterekhacheke yoolhia, ukhalhawaya baada yo mahuku mararu nnoolhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, urwaa ukhalhelhani ilhapo anivahilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu anouvahani ikhalheke nhakhu inyu.”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu o nikosho ni Narobeni ni Nagadi ni attu akina o nikosho ni Namanase wiira, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Muupuwelheke malhehero a ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo wiira, <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Manyaahanu inyu, achishana inyu ni mihuwo chinyu ni ashinama inyu o uhuwiya ahalheke mwiilhaponi mu, yaavahiye inyu ni ashinna Musa, ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Nansho manyaalhopwana onkhaye o machiri ni ikerero chaya alhapuweke mwoolhoko ni waahoolhelha ashilhoko inyu. <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />Mwaakaviheke mpaka Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya waavaha ashilhoko inyu ayo vakittu wo ukhalha, thoko chovanhe aya ni mwaatti, wiira akhalheke ilhapo anovahiya aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu. Mwamalhihaka nhokolhieke mwiilhaponi mwinyu, mwakhalhe, mwaavahiye inyu ni ashinna Musa, karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Nkayaakhulha Nayoshua, “Chittu chonkhaye chinilhehenre inyu ninoopanga, ni variwoothe vanohalha inyu uniruma ninoorwaa. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Thoko chaarumelhenlhe ihu ashinna Musa, phi chiichammo chinohalha ihu urumelhelhani inyuva, Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu akhalheke vamoka ni inyu vamoka thoko chaari aya wa ashinna Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Ntu riyoothe hinorumelhelha malhehero inyu ama ukhota urumelhelha malhove inyu ama ittu iriyoothe nnolhehera inyu, eeviyeke. Inyuva nansho nkhalheke ni machiri ni wiilhipiha.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nayoshua anowaaruma attu o uhotelha arwee Uyeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Paahi Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni ahaaruma attu eelhi wo nivitho ukhuma Ushitimu, arwee yahotelhe ilhapo ilhe ni hasa iwani yo Uyeriko. Nkayaarwa ni uphiya inupa ya nthiyana mmoka o ulhavalhava eehaniye Rahabu nkayaarupelha mwommo. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Amwene o iwani yo Uyeriko nkayaahimeriya wiira, “Mwooneke, manyaalhopwana eelhi o Uisraeli ahokelha vawani va lhelho uhiyu, uhotelha ilhapo.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Amwene o Uyeriko ayo nkayaaruma attu arwee wa Rahabu eeraka “Mwaakumihe vathe attu awiilhe uwaninyu ayo ukhalhawaya awiilhe uwehawehani ilhapo ihu yonkhaye.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Nansho yoyo nthiyana ayo ari anaavinthe yayo attu eelhi ayo. Paahi ttu aarumiye. “Ikekheene ahowa va, nansho mii akachuwenlhe unkhuma aya. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Ni ayo ahothama va, ipiiphi ihinaaya ukelha ikatema yo utteiya nlhako wo ukelha vawani. Ni ukittu ukenlhe aya mii akinchuwenlhe. Mwaakuvieke, mwaattwareke ni inyu nnowaapatta.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Nansho Narahabu ari anaawelhinhe vatharini attu o uhotelha ni waavitha wo waakhunelha mipeshi aathanlhe aya utharini uwo. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Paahi attu aarumiye ni amwene alhe nkayaatwarelhelha wo uvira iphiro yaakelha unolhapuwiya mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Ni phiyaru vaathamme aya, nlhako wo ukelhelha vawani nkawaatteiya.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Paahi attu o uhotelha ayo ahinaya urupa, Narahabu ahorwaa unupani uchulhu uwo, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />nkayeerelha wiira, “Mii kihochuwelha wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku ahouvahani mwaatti ilhapo ilha, ni woova uhonikelha, ni anenchi o ilha ilhapo yonkhaye ilha ahokhwa nrima wo nlhatu ninyu. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Ukhalhawaya niheewa iphiro Apwiiya Nlhuku choomihilhe aya maashi o ibahari yo Ushamu uhoolho winyu vathamilhe inyu ilhapo yo Umisri, ni inamuna chaalhakalhilhe inyu mamwene eelhi o Aamori Nasihoni ni Naoga yaakhalha ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. yaani sihoni ni ogu, <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Neeweke yoyo mwaha uyo nahokhwa nrima chinene wo nlhatu winyu, nkanaamalhelhiya machiri. Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu phi Nlhuku nchulhu wiirimu ni vathi velhaponi. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Wo chiichammo etu, chonte nkilhupelhelhe wo nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira nnookonelha ikiriri miyaano ni manyaalhoko aka, thoko miyaano chupangenlhe akani wo nrima woombone, nkipangelheke ittu yo ukooniha, yo ikekhiaye. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Nlhupelheke wiira nnowookholha athumwanaka ni anumwanaka, manyaarokoraka ni manyonnaka, ni manyaalhoko aya onkhaye, khannonihiya niiviyaka.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Attu o uhotelha alhe nkayaakhulha, “Ukumi inyu phi ukumi inyu! Yakhalhaka kannohimiacha milhatu ihu, Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya univaha ilha ilhapo ilha, ni hii ninoupangelhani moombone, inyuva ni ashilhoko inyu khanneeviya.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Paahi Rahabu nkaakurusha yayo attu ayo wo nkhoyi uvirelha vandirishani, ukhalhawaya inupa awe yaathekiye ilhutaanaka ni ishiri yo iwani yo Uyeriko. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Nkeerelha, “Nrweeke mweevitheke umwaakoni, wiira attu anootwarani ahuphwanyeni. Mwakhalheke wowo mahuku mararu mpaka attu anootwarelhelhani ayo vanohalha aya uhokolhia vawani, yamalhaka vavawo nrwaacheke.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Attu o uhotelha alhe nkayeerelha, “Hii ninootimiriha ulhupelha unulhupelhinhe inyu wu. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Vanohalha ihu ukelha mwiilhaponi mu, mmweeke mweettuka ulha nripwe wo khwiilha ulha vandirishani vanonikurushelha inyu va. Mwaathothokaniheke vava athumwaninyu, anumwaninyu, ashirokorinyu ni ashilhoko a athumwaninyu onkhaye. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Nansho ntu riyoothe akhumaka vathe, ni urwaa weetakacha mmawani, khaninokhalha ni nlhatu vachulhu nokhwa awe. Nansho yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe nookhalha unupani winyu, apattiyaka ni ittu etu, nookhwa awe nookhalha vachulhu wihu hii. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Nansho mwamwiirelhaka ntu riyoothe ulha mwaha ihu ulha, paahi hii khaninottukiya ni ulhupelha unilhehenre ihu wiira nilhupelhe uwo.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Ni uyo nkeerelhacha, “Ikhalheke thoko chinre inyu.” Nkaahiyerera arwee, ni ayo nkayaathamacha. Nkaattukelhelha nripwe wokhwiilha uyo vandirishani.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Attu o uhotelhacha alhe ahothamacha nkaarwaacha umwaakoni. Nkayaakhalhacha wowo wo mahuku mararu mpaka attu aattwarelhelha alhe vaahokolhianche aya Uyeriko, baada yo waattwarelhelha nansho wohoona. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Paahi attu o uhotelhacha eelhi alhe ahokhuruwa toka umwaakoni, nkayaalhapuwa mwoolhoko, nkayaahokolhia u Nayoshua. Nkayatangachera kila ittu ikhumelhenlhe, <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />nkeera, “Wo ikekhiaye Apwiiya Nlhuku ahonivaha ilhapo yonkhaye. Attu onkhaye wowo anoonova.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Aisraeli anoolhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Wichishuru washeekeru, Nayoshua vamoka ni attu onkhaye o Uisraeli ahochokholha nkwaha wo ukhuma Ushitimu. Yaphiyeke mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, aheesha nipuro vavawo wo ikatema, ahinaaya ulhapuwa. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Kaanyuma yo mahuku mararu, ahoolhelhi ahovira variyari wo nipuro nno, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />nkayeerelha attu wiira, “Vanohalha inyu woona Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, ninakushiye ni opochera ishaani Alawi nthameke ni utwara. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Nansho nhaatamerie chinene Nsanduku no Malhehano nno, nkhalheke utayi wo ikilometa imoka cho, wiira nchuwelheke iphiro yo ukelhelha, ukhalhawaya khannavira ilha iphiro ilha.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu, “Mwiitturieke, ukhalhawaya meelho Apwiiya Nlhuku anopanga ittu yo ushangiha variyari inyu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Yamalheke Nayoshua nkayeerelha opochera ishaani, “Nkusheke Nsanduku no Malhehano nhoolhelheke uhoolho wa attu.” Ni ayo nkayaakusha nkayaahoohelha uhoolho wa attu.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua, “Lhelho nna, kinoochokolha wooniha attu onkhaye o Uisraeli wiira inyuva phi nholhelhi aya, thoko chaari aka ni ashinna Musa, phi chiichammo chinohalha aka ukhalha vamoka ni inyuva. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Mwaalhehereke opochera ishaani anookusha Nsanduku no Malhehano mweerelheke emelhache vakiviru mmaashini, mwiinano wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani vanohalha aya uphiya wowo vawo.”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Yamalheke, Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu o Uisraeli, “Mmweeke vakhiviru, mwiiwe malhove a Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Nayoshua nkayaathepa waahimeria wiira, “Nlhuku ri nkumi ri variyari inyu neera wiira, nowoomolhacha uhoolho winyu attu o Ukanaani, attu o Uhiti, attu o Hivi, attu o Uperizi, attu o Ugirgashi ni attu o Uamoni wayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Mmweheke, Nsanduku no Malhehano na Athithi o ilhapo yonkhaye, nihaatameria uvira uhoolho winyu ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Vano, mwanthanlheke attu khumi ni eelhi ukhuma makosho o Uisraeli, kila nikosho akhumeke ntu mmoka. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Ikatema inyaa cha opochera ishaani anookusha Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Athithi o ilhapo yonkhaye vanohalha aya ukelha mmaashini, umwoolhokoni uwo, maashi anokhoolha ukhuma mpata wo uchulhu anoothothokana vamoka thoko ni ukhalha thoko nipuhe.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Paahi attu nkayaathama vamapuroni waya ni urwaa ulhapuwani mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, ni opochera ishaani anookusha Nsanduku no Malhehano alhe yahaaholhelha attu uholho. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Ni nkwaha etu yayo aankushe Nsanduku no Malhehano inyaa chaya chanyikalheke mwiinano wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 3:15">Mwolhoko o Uyorodani wahochara ikatema wo nlhaalha, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />maashi aakholha ukhuma uchulhu aheemelha ni ucharaana naawanelha mpaka Uadamu uwo, iwani yaatamanne ni iwani yo Usarathani. Maashi aakhoolha ya holhutana urwaa ibahari yo Maakha, ahowelhelha attu nkayaalhapuwa uhoolho wo Uyeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Ikatema attu o Uisraeli vaalhapuwa aya, opochera ishaani aakusha Nsanduku aheemelha vakittu vo wuuma iriyari yo mwoolhoko Yorodani mpaka attu onkhaye nkayaalhapuwa.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Malhuku khumi ni meelhi o nuupusho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Attu onkhaye Yamalheke ulhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Mwaathanlhe attu khumi ni eelhi munlhokoni mwa attu o Uisraeli ayo, yaani ntu mmoka kila nikosho, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />mwaalhehereke cho; ‘Nkusheke malhuku khumi ni meelhi ukhuma variyari yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, ukhuma vaa varii mieto cha opochera ishaani, nkusheke yayo malhuku ayo, mwookelheke vakittu vanohalha inyu urupelha uhiyu wo lhelho ulha vawo’ ”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Nayoshua nkayeehana attu khumi ni eelhi yaathanlhe aya munlhokoni mwa attu o Uisraeli, kila nikosho ntu mmoka, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />nkayeerelha, “Nhoolheke Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, mpaka iriyari yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Kila mmoka inyu akusheke nlhuku nimoka wo nlhatu no kila nikosho no attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Yoyo mwaha uyo unookhalha ittu yo wooniya uwaninyu. Ni achishana inyu vanohalha aya ukohani mahuku anowa, chani alha mahuku alha aarina maana ni uwaninyu? <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Mwaattiva mweerelheke, ‘Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku vaavirihiye aya umwoolhokoni uwo, maashi aheemesha ahikhoolhe.’ Wo chiichammo etu, alha malhuku alha anookhalha moopusho wa attu o Uisraeli iyaakha cho uhimalha.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Manyaalhopwana alhe nkayaapanga thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Nayoshua, nkayaakusha malhuku khumi ni meelhi ukhuma variyari yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, nlhuku nimoka wo nlhatu no kila nikosho no attu o Uisraeli, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku cheerenlhe aya Nayoshua, nkayaarwaana mpaka valhe vakittu varupenlhe aya nkayeesha wowo. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Nayoshua chiicho aheemesha malhuku khumi ni meelhi iriyari yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, vakittu veemenlhe aya inyaa cha opochera ishaani yaakhushilhe Nsanduku no malhehano alhe. Yayo malhuku ayo ahaawo mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Opochera ishaani yaakushilhe Nsanduku no Malhehano alhe, aheemelha iriyari yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani mpaka attu vaamalhihilhe aya uphanga kila ittu Apwiiya Nlhuku yaalhehenre aya Nayoshua aahimerie attu. Nayoshua ahopanga chonkhaye chaalheheriye aya ni ashinna Musa. Attu nkayaakuvia ulhapuwa mwoolhoko. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Attu onkhaye Yamalheke ulhapuwa, opochera ishaani alhe nkayahoolhelha uhoolho ni Nsanduku no malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku nne. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Manyaalhopwana o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi ni inusu yo nikosho ni Namanase anari ni ikerero chaya cho waatakanelha ikhoto, ahaaholhelha attu o Uisraeli, thoko chaalheheriye aya ni ashinna Musa. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Wo uholhelhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, attu o malhaku alufu arubaini anavanre ikerero chaya cho waatakanelha ikhoto, ahovira akelhelhaka uhito wo iwani yo Uyeriko.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Nenno nihuku nno Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaapanga attu o Uisraeli onkhaye achuwelhe wiira Nayoshua phi nholhelhi aya, ni ayo nkayeewelhelha Nayoshua mahuku aya onkhaye thoko cheewelhenlhe aya ashinna Musa mahuku aya onkhaye.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Yamalheke Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />aalhehereke opochera ishaani anookusha Nsanduku no Malhehano, athameke mmwoolhokoni Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Paahi, Nayoshua nkayaalhehera opochera ishaani alhe, “Nthamache mmwolhokoni Uyorodani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Ni opochera ishaani aakushilhe Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku ahothama iriyari yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, ni unyikhalha mwiinano wo mwoolhoko. Ni vavawo maashi o mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ahochokholha ukhoolha tho, ni uchara thoko varachi.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Attu o Uisraeli aholhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani nihuku no khumi no mweeri wo uchokholha, nkayeesha nipuro uwo iwani yo Ugilgali, unoshelha nchuwa iwani yo Uyeriko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Nayoshua nkayeemesha malhuku khumi ni meelhi Ugilgali akushilhe aya ukhuma umwoolhokoni Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu o Uisraeli wiira, “Achishana inyu vanohalha aya ukohani mahuku anowa o uhoolho, ‘chani, alha malhuku alha ari ni marumbo ni?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Mmweeke Mweerelha wiira, attu o Uisraeli aholhapuwa ulha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ulha vakittu vo wuuma. <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Mweerelheke wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, yoomihilhe maashi o mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani wo nlhatu winyu mpaka nkamwaalhapuwa, thoko choomihilhe aya ibahari yo Ushamu wo nlhatu ihu mpaka nkanaalhapuwa. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Wiira attu onkhaye o ilhapo achuwelhe wiira moono wa Apwiiya Nlhuku urina machiri, ni inyu mwaathimicheke Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu mahuku onkhaye o uhimalha.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Paahi mamwene onkhaye o attu o Uamoni yaakhalha ukhopelhelhe yo mpata uneelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni mamwene onkhaye a attu o Ukanaani yaari umbwaani wo ibahari yo Umediterenia, yeeweke wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku yahoomiha maashi o mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani wo nlhatu na Aisraeli mpaka vaamanlhe aya ulhapuwa, nkayaakhwa nrima, nkayaamalhelhiya machiri onkhaye wo woova attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiinelhiya unyawo wa attu o Uisraeli Ugilgali uwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, akooroshe mialho cha nlhuku noolhipa eenelhe unyawo attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Paahi Nayoshua ahokoorosha chechiyo mialho cho malhuku oolhipa chiyo ni weenelha unyawo attu o Uisraeli Ugibeahaaralothi uwo. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Nlhatu no weenelha attu o Uisraeli onkhaye phi ulha; attu o Uisraeli onkhaye, manyaalhopwana aakhume Umisri o machusha o urwaa ukhotoni, onkhaye ahokhwaacha vaari aya munkwahani uthakoni, baada yo uthana ilhapo yo Umisri. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Yayo onkhaye yaakhumme Umisri ayo ari o wiinelhiya, nansho onkhaye ayareelhe munkwahani uthakhwani uwo, kaayuma yo uthana Umisri alhe yaari ahineenelhiya unyawo. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Attu o Uisraeli aheeta iyaakha makhumi ncheshe mwiithuphini, ata manyaalhopwana onkhaye yaari ni machusha o urwaa ukhotoni nkayaarimelhacha. Ukhalhawaya khayewelhenlhe yaahimiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaalhupalhelha yayo attu ayo wiira khaanoona ilhe ilhapo yorera ulhima ni ulhihera mihuwo yaalhupenlhe aya manyaathumwanaya wiira anowaavaha. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Wo chichammo yaari achishana a attu ayo Apwiiya Nlhuku yonnuwihilhe aya kaanyuma aya, yayo phi ayo eenelhiye unyawo ni Nayoshua ayo, ukhalhawaya khayeenelhiye ikatema vaari aya munkwahani ilhe.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Manyaalhopwana onkhaye Yamalheke wiinelhiya, ahokhalha wilhaponi vanipuroni vawo mpaka vaalhamanche aya. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Yamalheke Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua, “Lhelho nna kihothamiherani ishoni yo Umisri ilhe.” Paahi vavawo vakittu vawo nkaveehaniya Ugilgali mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Attu o Uisraeli vaari ayo aneeshilhe nipuro Ugilgali uwo ahopanga isikukuu yo Pasaka, uchechilho wo nihuku no khumi ni ncheshe no mweeri vakittu vahiri ni miako, Uyeriko uwo. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Waashelhe waya, yaani kaanyuma yo nihuku no Pasaka aholhia mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure ni imbeyu cho ingaano cho waarikiya ukhuma choolhia cho yelhe ilhapo ilhe. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Paahi ukhuma nenno nihuku nno yaapieke choolhia cho ukhuma yeyo ilhapo iyo, attu o Uisraeli khayapantte mana tho. Ukhuma yeyo iyaakha iyo attu o Uisraeli aalhia choolhia cho ihapo yo Ukanaani.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayoshua ni ntu akunshe Mwaalho mulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Nihuku nimoka Nayoshua vaari aya anaatamenrie iwani yo Uyeriko, wo uhiweherera ahomwoona ntu mmoka neemenlhe uhoolho aya navanre uphanga mmoononi mwawe. Nayoshua ahonrweelha nkayaakoha, “Chani inyuva awihu ama a amalhaponi ihu?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Akihiwe awinyu wala a amalhaponi inyu. Nansho miyaano nhoolhelhi o mphingo wa manyaasikari a Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni vano kihowa.” Nayoshua nkooroma nkayanthimicha. Yamalheke nkayankoha, “Thithi, nnothanana miyaano karumiya inyu kipangekeni?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Nhoolhelhi o mphingo wa manyaasikari a Apwiiya Nlhuku uyo nkeerelha, “Nrulheke iratu chinyu ukhalhawaya vakittu aneemelha inyu phi vatakatifu.” Nayoshua nkayaapanga chiicho.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ukottolhiya ni ulhakalhihiya iwani yo Uyeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Mikhora chulhupalhe cho ukelhelha iwani yo Uyeriko chaari chinatteiye rata wo nhina, wiira yaatiyelhelhe Aisraeli ahikelhe. Khaawo ntu onrie ukhelha wala ukhuma yeyo iwani iyo. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, “Mwooneke, Miyaano kinouvahani machiri o ukottolha iwani yo Uyeriko vamoka ni amwene aya ni manyaasikari aya. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Inyuva ni alhe arii ni ikerero onkhaye nrukurerieke yeyo iwani iyo nkwaha mmoka kila nihuku wo mahuku sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Opochera ishaani saba, kila mmoka nakushilhe niphenga nawe no inyaka yo ikhondoro ilhopwana, aholhelheke uhoolho wo Nsanduku no Malhehano. Ni nihuku no saba nrukurierieke yeyo iwani iyo mikwaha saba uno opochera ishaani yoopaka maphenga. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Vanohalha aya woopa yayo maphenga ayo wo nlhove nulhuphalhe, ni inyu mwiiwaka etu nenno nlhove nno, attu onkhaye akhuwelheke chinene ni ishiri cho iwani chinoowulhuwa vathi. Kila ntu akelheke vawani vawo, wo ukhuma vakittu veemenlhe awe.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Paahi, Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni nkayeehana opochera ishaani, nkayeerelha, “Nkusheke Nsanduku no Malhehano, ni opochera ishaani saba akusheke maphenga saba o inyaka cho ikhondoro chilhopwana, ahoolhelheke uhoolho wo Nsanduku na Apwiiya Nlhuku.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Nayoshua enre wiira, “Arweeke uhoolho nrukurerieke iwani, ni attu anovara ikerero ayo arweeke uhoolho Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Wo utwaraana ni malhehero a Nayoshua, opochera ishaani saba yoopa maphenga saba o inyaka cho ikhondoro chilhopwana alhe, ahorwaa umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, utulhi waya attwariyaka ni Nsanduku no Malhehano nne. Ikatema yonkhaye maphenga oopiyaka. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Alhe attu avanre ikerero alhe nkayaaholhelha opochera ishaani oopa maphenga alhe, ni attu akina aalhita utulhi attwaraka Nsanduku no Malhehano utulhi, uno maphenga arumaka wo utwaraana. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Nansho Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu, “Nhinyakulhe ama ukumiha nlhove, wala nhuulhumache ittu iriyoothe, mpaka nihuku ninohalha aka uhimeriani wiira nkhuwelheke nne, yeyo ikatema iyo phi nohalha inyu ukhuwelha.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Paahi Nayoshua nkayaapanga attu alhe arukurerie iwani nkwaha mmoka, anakushilhe Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uhokolhia unipuroni urupani uhiyu.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Waashelhe waya Nayoshua ahonkwa mapikoosha ni opochera ishaani nkayaakusha Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku nne. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Opochera ishaani oopa maphenga saba o inyaka cho ikhondoro chilhopwana alhe ahohoolhelha Nsanduku na Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoopaka maphenga aya wo uhimaalha. Attu aavara ikerero alhe ahohoolhelha o woopa mapenga Nsanduku na Apwiiya Nlhuku ni attu akina alhitaka utulhi waya. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Nihuku no nayeelhi naya ahorukureria yeyo iwani iyo nkwaha mmoka, nkayaahokolhia tho unipuroni waya. Aapannge chiicho wo mahuku sita.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Nihuku no saba nkayonkwa mapikoosha, nkayaarukureria iwani iyo mikwaha saba thoko chiichammo. Yaari nenno nihuku nno etu vaarukurenrie aya yeyo iwani iyo mikwaha saba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Waphiyeke nkwaha wo saba ikatema opochera ishaani ahinaaya woopa maphenga, Nayoshua aheerelha attu wiira, “Nkhuwelheke, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomalha uvahani ilha iwani ilha. <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Yeyo iwani iyo ni kila ittu iriwo mwommo chinorimeelhihiya, ukhalhawaya iheeshiya wakfu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Rahabu, nthiyana o ulhavalhava ulhe phi nohalha woopolhiya vamoka ni attu ari nnupani mwawe ukhalhawaya ahaavitha attu ihu o uhotelha. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Nansho wowo nhikushe ittu iriyoothe ikumihiye wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira irimeelhihiye, mwakushakaru ittu iriyoothe yeeshiye wiira irimeelhihiye, nnoopanga nipuro no attu o Uisraeli ukhalha ittu yo urimeelhihiya, ni wo chiichammo nnoothapaniha. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Nansho nchurukhu wonkhaye, idhahabu, ikerero cho ishaaba ni iyuuma phi chittu cha Apwiiya Nlhuku, chechiyo etu chinoweeshiya munhakhuni mwa Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Paahi, attu nkayaakhuwelha uno maphenga oopiyaka. Attu yeeweke nlhove no maphenga ahokhuwelha chinene ni ishiri cho iwani chahowulhuwa vathi urr. Yeyo ikatema attu nkayaakelha vawani kila mmoka ukhuma vakittu veemenlhe awe, nkayaavara mateeka kila ittu. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Yamalheke nkayeevakacha kila ntu wo uphanga, manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana, ashimirawo ni ashulhupalhe. Nkayeevakacha ni ing'ope, ikhondoro ni iphuta.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu o uhotelha eelhi yaawehawenhe yeyo ilhapo iyo alhe wiira, “Nrweeke unupani wa nthiyana o ulhavalhava ulhe, mwammwiihe yoyo nthiyana uyo ni manyaalhoko awe onkhaye thoko chanlhupelhenlhe inyu.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Paahi ashimirawo o uhotelha alhe ahorwaa nkayamwiiha Rahabu, athumwanawe ni anumwanawe, achihima awe, manyaalhoko awe onkhaye, nkayeesha voombone vakhiviru ni nipuro na attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Yamalheke nkayaapaha mooro iwani yo Uyeriko ni kila ittu iriwo yaahikhalhe nchurukhu, idhahabu, ikerero cho ishaaba ni cho iyuuma, chiyo chaheeshiya nhakhu wo inupa ya Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Nansho Nayoshua ahookholha ukumi wa nthiyana o ulhavalhava ulhe, vamoka ni attu onkhaye o unupani wa athumwanawe. Rahabu nkaakhalha munkhokoni mwa attu o Uisraeli, ni iyari awe ihaawo wowo mpaka lhelho nna, ukhalhawaya ahaavitha attu aarumiye ni Nayoshua arwee ahotelhe iwani yo Uyeriko.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayoshua ahoolhumacha alhupelhaka uhoolho wo attu eeraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">“Ntu nohalha utheka tho iwani yo Uyeriko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">alhaviye ni Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Ntu riyothe nohalha utheka mmuto wo ilha iwani ilha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">mwaana awe o nttara akhweeke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Ntu riyoothe nohalha utheka mikhora cho yeyo iwani iyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">mwaamwanawe o ittiako akhweeke.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku yaari vamoka ni Nayoshua ni ipilhi chaya chahochuwania velhaponi wonkhaye.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Uwonya wa Naakani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli khayoonrie wiichinanelha wo chittu chaakumihiye wiira chirimeelhihiye, ukhalhawaya Naakani anaaya Nakarmi, anaaya Naazabudi, anaaya Nazera o nikosho ni Nayuda, ahokusha chittu chikina chikumihiye chaalheheriye wiira chipahiye. Paahi etu Apwiiya Nlhuku ahorushiya chinene vachulhu wa attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Nayoshua nkaaruma attu ukhuma Uyeriko arwee iwani yo Uai, vakhiviru ni Ubeth Aveni, unoosha nchuwa iwani yo Ubetheli, yeerelhaka “Nrweeke mwahotelhe ilhapo, ni ayo nkayaarwaa ni uhotelha iwani yo Uai.” <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Yahokolhieke nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, “Khuuwo nlhatu wo wathemwiha attu onkhaye waatakana ni attu o iwani yo Uai, ukhalhawaya anenchi aya ari vakani. Attu maelufu meelhi ama mararu anoothosha urweehiya.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Paahi attu maelufu mararu ahorwaa waatakana ni attu o iwani yo Uai, nansho nkayoomolhachiya ni attu o Israeli ahowomolhiya iwani iyo. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Attu o Uai nkayeeva attu o Uisraeli makhumi mararu ni sita ni woomolha akina ukhuma nlhako mulhupalhe wo ukelha vawani mpaka Ushebarimu nkayeerelha unokhuruwa mwaako. Aisraeli nkayaakhwacha nrima ni uthulhuwacha mmakhuvani.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Nayoshua nkayaahulha ikuwo chaya, yayo vamoka ni ashulhupalhe o attu o Uisraeli. Nkayeewulhusha makukhu vathi umihoolho wo Nsanduku na Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho, nkayeehelha ntukurukhu mmuruni mwaya, wooniha wiira ahochukulha. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Nayoshua nkeera, “Nihothapana hii, inyu Thithi Nlhuku! Nlhatu wani no unilhapusha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani wiira nikottolhiye ni attu o Uamoni wiira niivakachiye? Paahi ikaari nambaya nikaahanlhe ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Inyu Thithi, kiirekeni, yakhalhaka attu o Uisraeli ahaattawa amalhaponi aya? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Paahi Akaanaani vamoka ni anenchi onkhaye o ilha ilhapo ilha vanohalha aya wiiwa yoyo mwaha uyo, anonirukureria ni uniivakacha hii onkhaye va, nihoonie tho velhaponi va. Vano etu nnaapangekeni wooniha ikuru yo nchina ninyu?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, mweemelheke! Chani woonaka nheewulhusha makukhu vathi thoko chiicho? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Attu o Uisraeli ahowonya, ukhalhawaya ahohiya malhehano aka alhehenre aka wiira avarecheshe, ahokusha chittu chikina chikumihiye wiira chirimeelhihiye, aheiya ni uthephiacha, nkayaathakaniha ni chittu chaya. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Wo chiichammo etu, Aisraeli khannoria weemelha uhoolho wa amalhaponi aya, anowaattawa amalhaponi aya ukhalhawaya aheepanga ashinene ukhalha ittu yo urimeelhihiya, kinokhalha vamoka ni inyu tho mwaahitanganyeke chittu cheerelhiye inyu wiira nhikushe.<verse eid="JOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Paahi mweemelheke vano mwattukurieke attu, eechesheke tayari wo nihuku no meelho. Mwaahimerieke, ukhalhawaya miyaano Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli kineera cho, Munlhokoni mwinyu chihaawo chittu chikumihiye wiira chirimeelhihiye, khannoria waata amalhaponi inyu mpaka chechiyo chittu chiyo vanohalha aya uthamihiya iriyari inyu! <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Paahi etu meelho wichishu attu o Uisraeli onkhaye nrwaacheke umihoolho waka, nikosho kaayuma yo nikosho nikina. Nikosho ninohalha aka uthanlha ninoochushera uhoolho. Nihimo kaanyuma yo nihimo nikina. Nihimo ninohalha aka uthalha nno ninoochushera uhoolho, mmuchi kaanyuma ya mmuchi. Ni mmuchi anohalha aka waathanlha anoochushera uhoolho, ntu mmoka mmoka. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uthanlhiya nkaaphwanyiya nari ni chittu chikumihiye wiira chirimeelhihiye, norimeelhihiya wo mooro, yoyo vamoka ni kila ittu awe, ukhalhawaya khathiminche malhehano aka miyaano Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkaapanga ittu yo wuulhiha muru Israeli.<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Paahi Nayoshua nkayonkwa wichishuru nkaawiiha attu o Uisraeli onkhaye vakhiviru, nikosho wo nikosho, ni nikosho ni Nayuda nkanaathanlhiya. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Nkayaawiiha vakhiviru mahimo o nikosho ni Nayuda nihimo kaanyuma yo nihimo, ni nihimo ni Nazerahi nkanaathanlhiya. Nkaawiiha vakhiviru attu o nihimo ni Nazerahi, mmuchi kaanyuma ya mmuchi ni mmuchi a Nazabdi nkaathanlhiya. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Nayoshua ahaawiiha mmuchi a Nazabdi vakhiviru, ntu kaanyuma yo ntu, Naakani anaaya Nakarmi, anaaya Nazabdi, anaaya Nazera o nikosho ni Nayuda ahothanlhiya.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Nayoshua nkayeerelha Naakani, “Anaaka mwaathimicheke Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli, mwaatotopelheke, yamalhaka nkihimerieke chilhe chipangilhe inyu chilhe, wala nhikivithe.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Naakani nkayaakhulha, “We ikekheene! Kihowonya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli. Ni chiichammo phi pangilhe aka; <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Voonilhe aka ikuwo imoka yorera ukhuma Ushinari yo chittu chikushiye, ikilo imia piilhi cho nchurukhu ni mwiithi wo idhahabu yo ulhemelha wo ikilo makhumi nthanu, kahothanana nkakaakusha, kihoothipelha vathi nnihemani mwaka, ni nchurukhu uri wuuthi wo chechiyo chittu chiyo.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Paahi Nayoshua nkaaruma attu ni ayo nkayattimakelha unihemani wa Naakani. Ikekhiaye, chittu chiyo chaari chinavithiye unihemani ni nchurukhu waari wuuthi waya. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Nkayaakusha ukhuma unihemani ni urweeha wa Nayoshua ni attu onkhaye o Uisraeli, ni ayo nkayeesha vathi umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Nayoshua vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye nkayaakusha Naakani, anaaya Nazera vamoka ni nchurukhu, ikuwo ilhe, idhahabu, achishana aya ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana, ing'ope, iphuta, ikhondoro chaya, nihema naya ni kila ittu yaarina aya ni waarweha nikoote no Uakori. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Nayoshua nkayaakoha Naakani “Wo nlhatu waani nhoooniwihera wu uhuva? Apwiiya Nlhuku anouwiiherani uhuva inyuva mwaanene lhelho nna.” Attu o Uisraeli onkhaye nkayaata Naakani wo malhuku mpaka nkayaakhwa. phi, nkayaata manyaalhoko aya onkhaye wo malhuku mpaka nkayaakhwacha, nkayarimeelhihiya onkhaye wo mooro. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Chiicho Nkayookelha malhuku menchi vachulhu waya, ariwo mpaka lhelho. Vavawo urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkawaawolha, ni vavawo vakittu vavawo nkaveehaniya nikoote no Uakori, mpaka lhelho nna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:26">Urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkawaatondova.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Iwani yo Uai inoovariya mateeka ni ulhakalhihiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, “Nhoove wala nhikelhiye nipampa nirinoothe, mwaakusheke manyaasikari inyu onkhaye nrweeke iwani yo Uai, ukhalhawaya amwene o Uai kiheesha mmiononi mwinyu vamoka ni attu aya, iwani aya ni ilhapo aya. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Mwaapangelheke iwani yo Uai vamoka ni amwene aya thoko chaapangenlhe inyu iwani yo Uyeriko ni umwene awe vamoka ni mihuwo chaya chinohala inyu uvara mateeka chinookhalha chawinyu. Nrweeke mwaateke iwani iyo wo ukhumelhelha utulhi.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Paahi Nayoshua nkayaathama vamoka ni manyaasikari aya onkhaye urwaa Uai. Nkaathanlha attu o uchuwelha waatakana ikhoto maelufu makhumi mararu ni weerelha ahoolhelhe ikatema yo uhiyu. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Nkayaalhehera cho; “inyuv anoomindelha Mwiiwelhelhe mwaattiva iwani ukhuma mpata wo utulhi. Mweevitheke, nhirwee utayi ni iwani, nansho nkhalheke miitho ikatema yonkhaye. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Mii vamoka ni attu onkhaye arii vamoka ni mii, ninowaatameria iwani. Attu vanohalha aya ukhuma vathe uwa unittwarani thoko cheera aya mahuku o utulhi alhe, hiyaano ninowattawa. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Ni ayo vanohalha aya uthepa unittwara mpaka akhalhe utayi ni iwani aya, ukhalhawaya anaanyihereke wiira ahonoomolha thoko chaapannge aya mpacho. Hiyaano ninowaahiya anoomolheke. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Vavawo mwaattiva nkhumelhelheke ukhuma weevinthe inyu, ni uvara mateeka iwani aya, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu anouvahani yeyo iwani iyo. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Mwamalhihaka uvara mateeka iwani iyo, mwapaheke mooro. thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chilhehenre aya. Yayo phi malhehero anohalha inyu uttwara.” <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Paahi, Nayoshua nkayeerelha arwaacheke vakittu vaya wo wiivitha, ni ayo nkayaakhalha mpata uneelha nchuwa wo iwani yo Uai, iriyari yo iwani yo Uai ni Ubetheli. Nansho Nayoshua yaarumpe yoyo uhiyu uyo unipuroni wa attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Nayoshua nkayonkwa wichishuru nkayaathothokaniha attu o Uisraeli ni ukelhelha iwani yo Uai, anari vamoka ni ashulhupalhe. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Manyaasikari onkhaye yattukanne aya ahaatameria iwani ni weesha nipuro mpata wo uchulhu iwani Uai, variyari nikoote iwani yo Uai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Paahi nkayaakusha attu akina maelufu nthanu nkayeesha eevithe iriyari yo iwani yo Ubetheli ni Uai, uneelhelha nchuwa iwani yo Uai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Mphingo muulhupalhe wa manyaasikari weeshiye mpata wo uchulhu wo iwani, ni akina aahanlhe alhe eeshiye uneelha nchuwa ninomindelha wo iwani. Yoyo uhiyu uyo Nayoshua aarumpe uhito.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Amwene o iwani yo Uai yooneke chiicho, wichishuru ni urwaa uhito wo ukelhelha Uaraba wiira akumaane ni attu o Uisraeli ukhotoni. Nansho khayaachuwenlhe wiira iwani ayo yaari ineethelhiye ukhuma utulhi. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yamalheke Nayoshua vamoka ni attu aya nkayeepanga thoko wiira anowoochelha, nkayaachokholha uttawa akelhelhaka uthakoni. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Attu onkhaye yaari vawani vawo yaheehaniya wiira yaatware attu o Uisraeli, ni vaari aya yaatwarelhelhaka Nayoshua, ahothama vawani ni urwaa utayi ni iwani aya. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Khaawo ntu riyoothe aahanlhe iwani yo Uai, Ubetheli nkayaahiya mikhora wo uhitteiya, nkayaarwaa waatwarelhelha attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua “Nthoonyeke nivaka ninyu iwani yo Uai, ukhalhawaya kinouvahani yeyo iwani iyo.” Nayoshua nkayaathoonya nivaka naya iwani yo Uai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Phiyaru Nayoshua yathoonyeke nivaka naya Uai uwe, mphingo weethelha mpata nkina nkawaakhumelhelha ni ukelha vawani, nkawaavara mateeka iwani ni urimeelhiha wo mooro. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Attu o Uai yaweheke utulhi, nkayoona mwiishi ukhumaka uwani uwo uwelhaka mpaka wiirimu. Ni ayo khayoonrie uttawa mpata uriyoothe, ukhalhawaya attu o Uisraeli yahaarukunuwelha yayo yaatwarelhelha ayo. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Nayoshua ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye yooneke wiira mphingo weethelha uhovara mateeka iwani, ni wiira mwiishi waari uwelhaka nchulhu, yahaarukunuwelha ni uchokholha weeva Uai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Attu yaahanlhe vawani ahothama nansho onkhaye yaari anarukureriye ni attu o Uisraeli ari anavanre ilhapo yo Uai nkayakhuma watwarelhelha ayo nkayeeviya, hihalhaka ata ntu mmoka aya. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Nansho mwene o iwani yo Uai ahovariya mateeka anari akumi, ni urweehiya wa Nayoshua.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Attu o Uisraeli amalhiheke weeva attu onkhaye o Uai uthakoni uwo yaatwarelhenlhe alhe, ahohokolhia vawani Uai ni weeva attu onkhaye ahalhenlhe mwommo ayo. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Attu onkhaye o Uai yeeviye nenno nihuku nno manyaalhopwana ni manyaathiyana yaari wo umalhaka attu maelufu khumi na meelhi. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Nayoshua khayaakurunshe moono aya waavarenlhe aya nivaka naya uthoonya Uai, mpaka veevilhe aya attu onkhaye o yeyo iwani iyo. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Attu o Uisraeli ahovara ni ukusha; ashinama, ni nhakhu tho thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya Nayoshua. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Paahi Nayoshua ahorimeelhiha iwani yo Uai wo mooro ni uhiya mathalharu mpaka lhelho nna. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Yamalheke, nkayaathomia amwene o Uai umwirini mpaka uchechilho. Nansho nchuwa nachokholheke wiilha, Nayoshua aholhehera ntembo uyo uthamihiye umwirini warihiye vanlhakoni wo iwani. Yamalhaka, ookelhiye malhuku menchi vachulhu ntembo uyo, yayo malhuku ayo ahawo mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malhehero shomia umwakoni Ebali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Yamalheke, Nayoshua nkayaathekelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli madhubahu umwaakoni Uebali, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />Aapannge thoko ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya attu o Uisraeli, thoko chilhephiye aya nhina ikitabu yo ikekhiaye ya ashinna Musa wiira, “Anookhalha madhubahu athekiye wo malhuku ahihemiye wala ukwakwanyiya ni ikerero iriyoothe yo iyuuma.” Vachulhu wo yayo madhubahu ayo yaakumihere Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka cho upahiya vamooroni ni isadaka cho mpuha. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Ni uhoolho wo mphingo wonkhaye wa attu o Uisraeli, Nayoshua ahohokolhelha tho ulhepa ikekhiaye ya ashinna Musa vachulhu malhuku. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Attu o Uisraeli onkhaye vamoka ni ahoolhelhi aya, ashulhupalhe ni waamulha ni alheto onkhaye yaari aya, yaheemelha kila mpata awehaka Nsanduku no Malhehano uhoolho wa opochera ishaani Alawi yaakhushilhe Nsanduku no Malhehano na Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nusu aya aheemelha mwaako wo Ugerizimu ukhalhaka utulhi waya, ni nusu akina nkayeemelha uno mwaako wo Uebali unari utulhi waya, thoko ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya utulhi vawo, mwaha unaacha uvahiya mpuha wa attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Yamalheke, Nayoshua nkayaashomelha ikekhiaye chonkhaye, vamoka ni ibarakha ni malhavo thoko chilhephiye aya nhina ikitabu yo Malhehero. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Khanimo nlhove nalheeheriye ni ashinna Musa, Nayoshua nahaashomme aya uhoolho wa attu o Uisraeli, aariwo munlhokoni mwaya manyaathiyana, achishana ni alheto.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Attu o Ugibeoni anowichoopolha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Mamwene onkhaye ari ukhopelhelhe yo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ilhapo yo umiakoni ni ilhapo yo uhikhalhe miako ni mipatta chikina chonkhaye cho umbwaani yo ibahari yo Mediteraniya ukelhelha Lebanoni, attu o Uhiti, Aamori, attu o Ukanaani, Aperezi, attu o Hivi ni Ayebusi yewilhe aya ntenga wa attu o Aisreali. <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Yahothukumanacha vamoka ni nnikwa wo waatakana ikhoto Nayoshua ni attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Nansho attu o Ugibeoni yeeweke mwaha Nayoshua chaapannge aya wa attu o iwani cho Uyeriko ni Uai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />nkayamulha uphanga miruku. Nkayaakusha choolhia, nkayaachariha majuniya othaalha ni upachira vachulhu iphuta chaya, ni iviriba chothakalha ni uttotiya, <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />nkayaawara iratu cho uthaalha ni choolhia chaya chonkhaye chaari chowuuma ni chimelhe ittupeeru. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Paahi nkayaarwa wa Nayoshua unipuroni Ugilgali nkayeerelha anene ayo ni attu o Uisraeli, wiira, “Hiyaano nikhumme ilhapo yo utayi, chonte ninolhepelha wiira mpange malhehano ni hii.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli nkayaakhulha yayo attu o Hivi ayo wiira, “Ninoria vayi uphanga malhehano ni inyu mwaatti? Vekinaka inyuva nnokhalha ni hii.” <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Ni ayo nkayaakhulha Nayoshua, “Hiyaano akarumiya inyu.” Ni ayo Nayoshua nkayaakoha, “Mwaattiva phi mapani? Nnokhumelhelha vayi?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Nkayaakhulha, “Hiyaano akarumiya inyu nikhumme ilhapo yo utayi, niwiilhe ukhalhawaya niheewa utotopelhiya wo nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, ni niheewa kila ittu chaapangenlhe aya attu o ilhapo yo Umisri. <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />Niheewa chonkhaye chaapangenlhe aya mamwene eelhi a Aamori yaari ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, yaani amwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni ni amwene Naoga o Ubashani aakhalha Uashtaroti uwo. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Phi vavawo, ashulhupalhe ihu ni attu onkhaye o ilhapo ihu vaanirenlhe aya wiira, nkusheke mashurupu o unkwahani, nirwe nakumaane, ni mwaattiva ni uwiirelhalhakani wiira Hiyaano akarumiya inyu, chonte mpangeke malhehano ni hii. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Mwooneke mikatte chihu, chaari ni ntukutta vaakushilhe ihu vaathama ihu uwanihu, nansho vano chihooma ni ukelhiya ittupeeru. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Ni mitumpa cho marapalha chi nahochariha idivai chinari cho naanano, nansho vano chihophwiakacha. Ata ikuwo ni iratu chihu chihothaalha, ukhalhawaya nkwaha waari wo urekama chinene.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli ahokusha choolhia chaya wo uhaakoha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Nayoshua nkayaalhehana malhehano o mpuha, nkayaalhehana wiira anowaahiya ukhalha akumi. Aholhelhi o milhoko cha attu o Uisraeli nkayalhupelhelha wiira anoovarechesha yayo malhehano ayo.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Mahuku mararu baada yo upangiya malhehano ni yayo manyaattu ayo, attu o Uisraeli ahochuwelha wiira yayo attu ayo ari o waatamana aya ni ayo aakhalhacha munlhokoni mwaya. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayattuka nkwaha, kaayuma yo mahuku mararu nkayaaphiya iwani chaya. Chechiyo iwani chiyo chaari; Ugibeoni, Ukefar, Ubealothi ni Ukiriathyearimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli khayeevilhe, ukhalhawaya ahoolhelhi o nlhoko wa attu o Uisraeli yahaalhupelhelha wo nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli. Paahi nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu nkawaachukulhacha umihoolho wa aholhelhi aya ayo. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Nansho aholhelhi o nlhoko wa attu o Uisraeli nkaweerelha attu aya ayo wiira, “Ukhalhawaya nihaalhupelhelha wo nchina na Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku o Uisraeli vano khaninooria waapangelha ittu yo waathuria. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Ninowaahiya akhalhe akumi wiira nihiwe nitwarushiyaka wo nlhatu no ulhupelha ulhupenlhe ihu. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Mwaahiyeke akhalheke akumi.” Paahi etu attu o Ugibeoni nkayaakhalha yaatumikelhaka attu o Uisraeli onkhaye, yaaremelhaka ikhuni ni waarikelha maashi, thoko ahoolhelhi a attu o Uisraeli chenre aya wo uhimia.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Nayoshua nkayeehana attu o Ugibeoni ni waakoha, “Wo nlhatu waani mwahonithepia wiira mwaakhumme ilhapo yo utayi, ni uno mwaattiva nnokhalha vakhiviru ihu? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Vanova mwaattiva nholhaviya ni akina inyu ikatema yonkhaye nnookhalha ipotta cho urema ikhuni ni urika maashi wo nlhatu yo inupa ya Nlhuku aka.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Attu ayo nkayaakhulha Nayoshua wo wiira, “Nahohimeriya wiira wo ikekhiaye Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, yahalheehera karumiya aya ashinna Musa yaarimelhinhe enenchi onkhaye o ilha ilhapo ilha, ni uvahani mwaattiva ilha ilhapo ilha ikhalhe yawinyu. Wo chiichammo etu, nahoovelhelha ukumi ihu, paahi nkanaapanga ulha mwaha ulha. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Vanova hiyaano niri mmiononi mwinyu nnipangelheke thoko chinoona inyu ukhalha rata.” <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Paahi yaapangenlhe aya yaari phi woopolha mmiononi mwa attu o Uisraeli wiira aheevakachiye, paahi khayeeviye. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Nansho ukhuma nenno nihuku nno, Nayoshua nkayaapanga yayo ukhalha o urema ikhuni ni urika maashi wo nlhatu na attu o Uisraeli, ni wo nlhatu no madhuhabu a Apwiiya Nlhuku, variwoothe Apwiiya Nlhuku vathanlhilhe aya, mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Aamori anookottolhiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Amwene Naadonisedeki o Uyerusalemu aheewa Nayoshua chenre aya wo uvara mateeka iwani yo Uai ni amwene aya ni ulhakalhiha yeyo iwani iyo thoko chaapangenlhe iwani yo Uyeriko ni amwene aya. Tho aheewa wiira anenchi o Ugibeoni ahaavia iphiro yo waathana wo mpuha ni Aisraeli ni wiira vano anokhalha munlhokoni mwaya. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Yoyo mwaha uyo wahohelha nipampa chinene iwani yo Uyerusalemu, ukhalhawaya iwani yo Ugibeoni yaari thoko iwani irii ni umwene. Ni tho yeyo iwani iyo yaari yo uchuwania upwaha iwani yo Uai ni manyaalhopwana aya onkhaye ari manyaasikari o uminda chinene. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Paahi Amwene Naadonisedeki nkayaaruma nttenga wa amwene Nahohamu, o Uhebroni, amwene Napiramu o Uyarmuthi, ni amwene Nayafia o Ulakishi ni amwene Nadebiri o Uegloni nkayeerelha, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“Mmwe nkikavihe naarimelhihe attu o Ugibeoni ukhalhawaya ahaavia iphiro yo waathana wo mpuha ni Nayoshua vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Yamalheke, yayo mamwene athanu o Uamori ayo, amwene o Uyerusalemu, amwene o Uhebroni, amwene Nayarmuthi, amwene o Ulakishi, ni amwene o Uegloni, aholhutaaniha miphingo chaya, nkayaarwaana mpaka Ugibeoni, nkayeesha nipuro urukureriya yeyo iwani iyo, nkayaata.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Attu o Gibeoni nkayanrweeha nttenga u Nayoshua unipuroni Ugilgali uwo, nkayeerelha, “Chonte nhinihiye hiyaano akarumiya inyu, mwaakuvieke nniwe mwaanikaviha ni unoopolha, ukhalhawaya mamwene onkhaye a Uamori ukhuma ilhapo cho umiakoni ahowa unaatakachani.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Paahi Nayoshua vamoka ni manyaasikari aya onkhaye ahothamacha Ugilgali. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, “Nhoove ata vakani ukhalhawaya kihaahelha mmiononi mwinyu, wala khaawo ata mmoka nohalha wooria uwaatani.” <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Baada yo weeta uhiyu wonkhaye ukhuma Ugilgali, Nayoshua ahaakhumelhelha, ahikhulhuvelhaka. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaahelha nipampa nulhuphalhe uhoolho wa attu o Uisraeli yeevilhe attu enchi Ugibeoni uwo, nkayaatoporaniha wo iphiro yo inokuruwa ukelhelha uhito wo Ubethhoroni, mpaka Uazeka ni Umakeda, ni uwo weevilhe aya attu enchi chinene chiicho uwo. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Vaari aya yaattawaka Aisraeli unokhuruwelha mwaako Ubethhoroni, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoruphiha iphulha yo malhuku molhupalhe ukhuma wiirimu anari mphironi mpaka Uazeha, ata yaakhwiilhe wo yayo malhuku ayo nkayaakhalha enchi upwaha yeeviye ni ikerero cha attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Ikatema ya Apwiiya Nlhuku vaakottonlhe aya Aamori, ni waahelha mmiononi mwa attu o Uisraeli Nayoshua yahaalhepelha Apwiiya Nlhuku uhoolho wa attu o Uisraeli onkhaye, eeraka wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">“Inyuva nchuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">mweemelhe etu vachulhu ilhapo yo Gibeoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">Inyuva mweeri uhito wa Uayaloni.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Nchuwa nkaneemelha yii ni mweeri waheemelha mpaka ilhapo yo Uisraeli naalhivelhinhe aya amalhaponi aya. Thoko chaalhepilhe aya nhina ikitabu i Nayashari, nchuwa aheemelha yii variyari irimu, nkanaahiya nkwaha aya wo ukelha uwiilhani wo nihuku nonkhaye. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />nihuku toka nenno khaninapacha ukhalha mena woonia tho, nihuku Apwiiya Nlhuku naamwiwelhenlhe aya ntu thoko chiichammo, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku anene ahenkelha attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Yamalheke, Nayoshua ahohokolhia unipuroni Ugilgali uwo, vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayoshua anowaavara mateeka mamwene athanu a Aamori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Mamwene athanu alhe ahottawa ni wiivitha unikhukuni Umakeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Nayoshua nkayeewa wiira mamwene athanu ayo ahooniya ukittu wiivithilhe aya, unikhukuni Umakeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Nkeera, “Mpirikisheke malhuku molhupalhe vanlhakoni wo nikhuku vawo, ni weesha uhitelhelha. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Nansho mwaatti nhikhalhe wowo, Baali mwaattwareke amalhaponi inyu. Mwaatakacheke ukhuma mpata wo utulhi, ni mena nhaahiyerere akelhe mmawani mwaya, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ahookottolhelhani.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Nayoshua vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli ahaatakacha ni waalhakalhiha onkhaye, ni akina vakani ahokulhuphuwa ni uttawelha mmawani mwaya mwaarukureriye ni ishiri. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Yamalheke yayo, attu o israeli ahohokolhia salama u Nayoshua unipuroni Umakeda, ni khaariwo tho ntu onrie wulhumacha ittu iriyoothe vachulhu attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Yamalheke Nayoshua aheera, “Nhulheke nikhuku nno, mwaawiheke mamwene athanu alhe.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Nkayaapanga chiicho, ni waawiihera Nayoshua mamwene athanu alhe, yaani, Amwene o Uyerusalemu, amwene o Uhebroni, amwene o Uyarmuthi, amwene o Ulakishi ni amwene o Uegloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Mamwene ayo vaawihiye aya, Nayoshua aheehana attu onkhaye ni manyaaholhelhi o miphingo aattukanne aya ukhotoni, nkeerelhacha, “Nrwaacheke, mmwe mwaanyikalhacha mamwene alha nshikoni mwaya.” Ni attu ayo ahochusheracha ni waanyikalhacha mmashikoni mwaya. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Nayoshua nkeerelha “Nhoove, mena nhikelhiye nipampa, mwiilhipiheke, ukhalhawaya cho phi chiichammo Apwiiya Nlhuku chinohalha aya waapangelha amalhaponi inyu onkhaye anohalha inyu waatakana. Paahi etu mwiilhipiheke rata.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Kaanyuma, Nayoshua aheevakacha mamwene wo waathomiacha vamwirini miri mithanu, mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Ikatema nchuwa veelha aya, Nayoshua aholhehera wiira athamihiye mmirini mwaathomiachiye aya mmo, ni urihelhiya unikhukuni weevithanche aya. Yamalheke, aheesha malhuku molhupalhe vanlhakoni wo nikhuku vawo, ni yayo malhuku ayo ahawo mpaka lhelho nna.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nayoshua anoovara mateeka iwani chikina cha Aamori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Nenno nihuku Nayoshua naavanre aya mateeka iwani yo Umakeda nno, aheeva amwene ni attu aakhalhacha mwommo onkhaye wo unhihalhiha ata ntu mmoka. Nkaapangelha amwene o Umakeda thoko chaapangenlhe aya amwene o Uyeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Ukhuma Umakeda, Nayoshua vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahorwaa Ulibna, ni waatakacha ilhapo iyo. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakottolha yeyo iwani iyo vamoka ni amwene aya, mminoni wa Aisraeli, nkayeevakacha attu onkhaye wo nhinhiya ata ntu mmoka. nkayampangelha mwene o libna ukhuma aapangilhe amwene o Uyeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Baada yo uthana Ulibna, Nayoshua ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahorwaa Ulakishi, nkayaarukureria ni ukelhelha. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakottolha yeyo iwani iyo yo Ulakishi, ni uhelha mmiononi mwa attu o Uisraeli, nkayaavara mateeka nihuku no nayelhi. Nkayeevakacha attu onkhaye aakhalhacha mwommo, thoko chenre aya iwani yo Ulibna.<verse eid="JOS 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Vavawo amwene Nahoramu o Ugezeri ahowa uwaakavihani attu o Ulakishi. Nansho Nayoshua aheeva yayo vamoka ni attu aya onkhaye, wo uhinhalhiha ata mmoka.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Yamalheke uthana Ulakishi, Nayoshua ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahorwaa mpaka Uegloni, nkayaarukureria ni ukelhelha. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Nkayaavara mateeka nenno nihuku ni weevakacha attu aakhalhacha wowo, thoko chenre aya wo iwani yo Ulakishi.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Tho, baada yo uthana Uegloni, Nayoshua ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahorwaa mpaka Uhebroni, nkayaakelhelha <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />ni uvara mateeka. Nkayeevekacha attu onkhaye aakhalhacha wowo, vamoka ni mamwene aya, nkayaalhakalhiha lhakalhaka iwani chaatamana chiyo, ni weevakacha attu onkhaye thoko chenre aya wo iwani yo Uegloni.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Yamalhekeru, Nayoshua ni attu onkhaye o Uisraeli ahohokolhia Udebiri, nkayaakelhelha. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Nkayaavara mateeka iwani iyo ni amwene aya vamoka ni iwani chikina chaarukureria ni weevakacha attu onkhaye aariwo, wo uhinhalhiha ata ntu mmoka. Yaapannge chiicho yeyo iwani iyo, thoko chenre aya wo iwani cho Uhebroni ni Ulibna, ni mamwene aya.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Paahi, Nayoshua ahovara mateeka ilhapo yonkhaye, nkaakottolhacha mamwene o ilhapo cho umiakoni, ilhapo yo Unegebu, ni ilhapo yo uhikhalhe miako ni chinokhuruwelha umiakoni. Khayaahiilhe ittu iriyoothe ikumi, nansho aholhakalhiha kila ittu thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku o Uisraeli chenre aya wo ulhehera. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Nayoshua ahaakottolha attu onkhaye ukhuma Ukadeshbarnea mpaka Ugaza, ni ukhuma Ugosheni mpaka Ugibeoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Ahokusha ilhapo ilha yonkhaye, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli ahaatakanelha attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Paahi, Nayoshua ahohokolhia mpaka unipuroni Ugilgali uwo, vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Nayoshua anowaakottolha mamwene o nchulhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Amwene Nayabini o iwani yo Uhazori veewilhe aya yoyo mwaha uyo, yahorweha nttenga wa amwene Nayobabu, o Umadoni ni wa amwene o Ushimrani, ni wa amwene o Uakshafi, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />ni wa mamwene arii umiakoni mpata wo uchulhu, ni mamwene aakhalha Uaraba mpata wo uchawa wo Ukinerothi, umakoteni ni yaari Unafothdori mpata uneelha nchuwa. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />yahorweeha nttenga wa Akaanani yaari mpata unoosha nchuwa ni uneelha nchuwa, wa Aamori, wa attu o Uhiti, wa attu o Uperizi, wa Ayebusi yaakhalhaka umiakoni ni wa attu o Hivi yaakhalha vakhiviru ni mwaako wo Uhermoni ilhapo yo Umizpa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Paahi nkayaathama onkhaye ni miphingo chaya chulhupalhe cho manyaasikari. Ni ayo ari enchi thoko nhaava wo umbwaani vamoka ni nkukuta cho upurulhiya ni a farasi ni ifarasi akina enchi chinene. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Alha mamwene onkhaye alha aholhutaana vamoka ni weesha nipuro naya vanraponi Umeromu wiira yaatakane ikhoto ni attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Nayoshua, “Nhoove yayo, ukhalhawaya meelho, ikatema thoko ilha, kinowaarimeelhiha onkhaye wo nlhatu no attu o Uisraeli, ni inyu nnootupulha mithinga cha a farasi aya ni upaha mooro nkukuta chaya.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Paahi, wo uhikhulhuvelhiya unraponi Umeromu Nayoshua vamoka ni mphingo aya wonkhaye ahokhumelhelha ni waatakacha. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaavaha ukottolha attu o Uisraeli, ni ayo nkayaatakacha ni waatopora mpaka Usidani Yulhupalhe ni Umisrefothmaimu, mpaka mpata wo unoosha nchuwa uhito wo Umizpa. Attu o Uisraeli nkayaata ni weevakacha onkhaye. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yamalheke, Nayoshua ahotupulhacha mithinga cha a farasi aya chonkhaye ni upaha mooro nkukuta chaya, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Vaari aya ahokolhiaka, Nayoshua ahovara maateka iwani yo Uhazori. Nkayeeva amwene aya ukhalhawaya phi ari nashirongora o chechiyo imwene chonkhaye chiyo. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Yamalheke ahochokholha owiiva ankayaapaha mooro iwani yo Uhazori ni weeva attu aya onkhaye, ahinhiyaka ata ntu mmoka.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Chiicho tho ahovara mateeka iwani chikina chonkhaye chilhe ni weevakacha mamwene aya onkhaye, thoko ashinna Musa, karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Nansho attu o Uisraeli nkayapanhe mooro iwani chaari umiakoni cho mathalha aya, nansho uwani wa Uhazori vekha aya, Nayoshua phi yaarimelhinhe. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Attu o Uisraeli ahokusha chittu chonkhaye chaavanre aya mateeka ni ashinama o chechiyo iwani chiyo, ni weeva attu aya onkhaye, ni wala khayanhiilhe ata ntu mmoka. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku venreenlhe aya ashinna Musa wiira, ni ayo ashinna Musa nkayaalhehera Nayoshua yaapannge wo hihiya ittu Apwiiya Nlhuku yaalhehenre ashinna Musa<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilhapo chiavariye mateeka ni Nayoshua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Nayoshua ahovara mateeka ilhapo yonkhaye: Mipatta cho umiakoni ni ilhapo yo Unegebu, ilhapo yo Ugosheni, ilhapo yo uhikhalhe ni miako, ilhapo yo Uaraba, miako cho Uisraeli ni mipatta chaya cho uhikhalhe ni miako, <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />yahaavara mateeka ni weeva mamwene onkhaye o chechiyo ilhapo chiyo, uchokholha mwaako wahaarina ittu wo Uhalaki waatameria ni Useiri mpaka Ubaalgadi unikoote no Lebanoni, ni uchawa wo mwaako wo Uhermoni. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Ikhoto yaatakanne aya Nayoshua ni yayo mamwene onkhaye ayo yahopicha chinene. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Khiiwo uwani yaapannge malhehano o mpuha ni attu o Uisraeli, yaahikhalhe uwani yo Ugibeoni vekha aya, waakhalha aya attu o Hivi. Attu o Uisraeli ahovara mateeka iwani chikina chonkhiaye cho waatakana ikhoto. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Yaari uthanana waya Apwiiya Nlhuku anene ulhipiha mirima cha attu o ilhapo chikina chiyo, wiira yaatakane ikhoto. Aalhakenlhe wiira ahoonelhiye ikiriri nansho arimeelhihiye. Phi chiicho Apwiiya Nlhuku chalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayoshua ahorwaa, nkayaarimeelhiha Aanaki yaakhalha umiakoni Uhebroni, Udebiri, Uanabu, ilhapo yonkhaye yo miako cho Uyuda ni Uisraeli. Nayoshua yahaarimeelhiha yayo attu ayo vamoka ni iwani chaya. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Khaawo ntu o nikosho ni Naanaki ahalhenlhe ilhapo yo Uisraeli, yaahanlhe vakani etu iwani cho Ugaza, Gathi ni Uashdodi.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Paahi, Nayoshua ahokusha ilhapo yonkhaye wo ulhikaana ni alhe onkhaye Apwiiya Nlhuku yeerenlhe aya ashinna Musa. Nayoshua nkayaavaha attu o Uisraeli ilhapo iyo ikhalhe yawaya, akawane wo ulhikaana ni makosho aya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Paahi ikhoto Yamalheke, ilhapo yonkhaye yahokhalha ni mpuha, ni khawaakhanlhe ikhoto ikina tho.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mamwene yaakottolhiye ni attu o Uisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Anottwara alha phi mamwene aakottolhiye ni attu o Uisraeli, ni ukushiya ilhapo aya yonkhaye yaari unoosha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ukhuma ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uarnoni mpaka mwaako wo Uhermoni, ni ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uraba yaari mpata unoosha nchuwa. <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Amwene Nasihoni a Aamori yaakhalha Uheshboni uwo ni utawara ukhuma nipuro naya nuulhupalhe Uaroeri uwo, iwani yaari nchereshere yo nikoote no Uarnoni. Ahotawara chiicho uchokholhelha iriyari yo nikoote mpaka mwoolhoko wo Uyaboki waari aya mwiinano wo ilhapo ya attu o Uamoni yaari nusu yo ilhapo yo Ugileadi. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Chiichammo ahotawara ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uaraba, ukhuma ibahari yo Ukinerothi, mpata unoosha nchuwa mpaka Ubeth yeshimothi ibahari yo Maakha ni ukhelhelha mpaka wuuthi mwaako wo Upisga.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Akina phi amwene Naoga mmoka a Aarefai yaahalhenlhe aatawara Ubashani, aakhalha Uashtorothi ama Uedrei.<verse eid="JOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Umwene aya ahowanelha umwaakoni Uhermoni uwo, Usaleka, Ubashani wonkhaye mpaka miinano cha attu o Ugeshuri ni attu o Umaaka, nusu yo Ugileadi mpaka uwiinanoni mwo ilhapo ya amwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli yahaakottolha yayo mamwene ayo, nkayaavaha chechiyo ilhapo chiyo makosho a Narobeni, a Nagadi, ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase chikhalhe chawaya.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamwene aakottolhachiye ni Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Yamalheke Nayoshua vamoka ni attu o Uisraeli yahaakottolha mamwene onkhaye ari uneelhelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, uchokholhelha Baali gadi uhito wo Lebanoni mpaka mwaako wo uhikhalhe ittu wo Uhalaki, uchawa vakhiviru ni Useiri. Nayoshua nkayaakawelha makosho a attu o Uisraeli chechiyo ilhapo chiyo chikhalhe chawaya. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Chechiyo ilhapo chiyo chaari vamoka ni isehemu yo umiakoni, ilhapo chihiri ni miako, ilhapo yo Uaraba, uhito wo miako, ithuphi, ni ilhapo yo Unegebu. Chechiyo ilhapo chiyo chaari cha; attu o Uhiti, Aamori, attu o Ukanaani, attu o Uperizi, attu o Uhiti, attu o Hivi ni Ayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Attu o Uisraeli ahaakottolha mamwene o chi ujeriko, amwene o Uai iwani urii vakiviru Ubetheli, ilhapo chi; <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />amwene o Uyerusalemu, amwene o Uhebroni, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />amwene o Uyarmuth, amwene o Ulakishi, <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />amwene o Uelgoni, amwene o Ugezeri, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />amwene o Udebiri, amwene o Ugederi, <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />amwene o Uhorima, amwene o Uaradi, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />amwene o Ulibna, amwene o Uadulamu, <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />amwene o Umakeda, amwene o Ubetheli, <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />amwene o Utapua, amwene o Usheferi, <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />amwene o Uafeka, amwene o Ulasharoni, <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />amwene o Umadoni, amwene o Uhazori, <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />amwene o Ushimronmeroni, amwene o Uakshafi, <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />amwene o Naanaki, amwene o Umegido, <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />amwene o Ukedeshi, amwene o Yokneamu iwani irii mwaako wo Ukarmeli, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />amwene o Udori ilhapo yo Unafothdori, amwene o Ugoiimu Ugilgali uwo ni, <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />amwene o Utirza. Mamwene onkhaye ayo yaari makhumi mararu ni mmoka.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaari ihinavariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayoshua ari anolhuvanlhe o iyaakha chinchi. Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha wiira, “Inyuva vano nhoolhuvalha, o iyaakha chinchi, ni chihohalha ilhapo yulhupalhe ihinakushiya. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Chechiyo ilhapo chiyo phi, ilhapo yonkhaye ya Afilisti ni ilhapo yonkhaye ya Ageshuri, <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />yaani ilhapo inochuwania wiira ya attu o Ukanaani, uchokholhelha nshepa no Ushihori mmwiinanoni mwo Umisri mpaka ilhapo yo Uekroni mpata wo uchawani. Ilhapo yonkhaye ya atawara athanu o ilhapo yo Ufilisti: Gaza, Ashidodi, Ashkeloni, Gathi, ni Ekroni vamoka ni ilhapo ya Avi mpata o uchawa. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />mpata wo uchulhu. Chiichammo ilhapo cha attu o Ukanaani uchokholhelha Uara ya Asidoni mpaka Uafeki mmwiinanoni mwa Aamori, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />tho chiichammo ilhapo cho Ugebai ni Lebanoni unoshelha nchuwa Lebanoni, wuuthi mwaako wo Uhermoni mpaka Ulebo Uhamathi, <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />chiicho ilhapo yo umiakoni variyari wo Lebanoni ni Umisrefothmaimu, yaakhalhiya ni anenchi aakhalha Usidoni. ikadiri Aisreali anothepacha urwaa umihoolho wo chechiyo ilhapo chiyo, miyaano kimwanene kinowoomolha attu o chechiyo ilhapo chiyo ashinene oonaka. Ni inyu mwaakawelheke attu o Uisraeli mpatta wo chechiyo ilhapo chiyo, wo woopa ikhura thoko chinre aka wo ulheherani. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Mwaakawelheke chechiyo ilhapo chiyo makosho tisa ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase ahinapatta ittu ayo.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umianihia mpata unoshelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Makosho a Narobeni, Nagadi, ni nusu ikina yo makosho a Namanase ahovahiya ilhapo irii mpata wo vathi wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya Ashinna Musa, karumiya aya. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Ilhapo aya yaari uchokholhelha Uaroeri nchereshere nshepa no Uarnoni ni iwani yaari variyari nshepa, ni ilhapo yonkhaye yo uhikhalhe miako ukhuma Umadeba mpaka Udiboni, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />vamoka ni iwani ya amwene Nasihoni o Uamori yaatawanre Uheshboni mpaka umwiinanoni mwa attu o Uamoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />vamoka ni ilhapo cho Ugileadi, ilhapo ya Ageshuri ni ya Aamaakhathi, mwaako wo Uhermoni ni ilhapo yonkhaye yo Ubashani mpaka Usaleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />ni umwene wonkhaye u Naoga mmoka a Arefai yaahalhenlhe, yaatawanre Uashtarothi uwo, ni Uedrei, Ubashani. Ashinna Musa ahaakottolha yayo onkhaye ayo ni ukusha ilhapo aya. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Ata chiicho Ageshauri Aisraeli khayoomolhiye ni Amaaka, nansho anokhalha munlhokokoni helho nna.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Ashinna Musa khayaavanhe attu o nikosho na Alawi ilhapo iriyoothe. Nansho isadaka chaakumiheriye aya Apwiiya Nlhuku o Uisraeli wo upahiya vamooroni. Chechiyo phi ari chawaya thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku cheerenlhe ashinna Musa.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwani chaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Narobeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Mpatta wo ilhapo ashinna Musa yaavanhe aya attu o nikosho na Narobeni wo ulhikaana ni manyaalhoko aya, <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />yaari uchokolhelha Uaroeri nchereshere nshepa no Uarnoni ni iwani yaari nenno nshepa nno vamoka ni ilhapo yonkhaye ihirii yo miako yo Umedeba. <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Yaari chiicho vamoka ni Uheshboni ni iwani chaya chonkhaye chaari uhiri yo miako, yaani Udiboni, Ubamothbaali, Ubethbaali meoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Uyahasa, Ukedemothi, Umefaathi, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Ukiriathaimu, Usibma, Userethshahari, umiakoni uhito uwo, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Ubethpeori, unokhuruwelha mwaako wo Upisga, Ubeth yeshimothi, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />ni iwani chonkhaye chihiri cho miako, ilhapo yonkhaye ya amwene Nashihoni a Aamori aatawara Uheshboni uwo, ashinna Musa ahaakottolha Nasihoni vamoka ni ahoolhelhi o Umidiani, Uavi, Urekemu, Usuri, Uhuri, ni Ureba, aatawara ilhapo vakittu va amwene Nasihoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />mmoka a attu eeviye ni attu o Uisraeli ari Nabalaamu, ntu o ulhohera chittu, anaaya Nabeori. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Mwiinano wo ilhapo yo nikosho ni Narobeni mpata uneelha nchuwa waari mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Iwani ni ittoko chiromolhiye va, phi chiyo chaavahiye aya attu o makosho a Narobeni.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwani chaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Nagadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Ilhapo ashinna Musa yaavanhe aya attu o nikosho ni Nagadi wo ulhikaana ni makosho aya, <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />yaari Uazeri, iwani chonkhaye cho Ugileadi ni nusu yo ilhapo ya attu o Uamoni mpaka Uaroeri irii vakiviru uwani o Uaraba, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />tho uchokholha Uheshboni mpaka Uramathmizpe, Ubetonimu, ni ukhuma Mahanaimu mpaka Udebiri, <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />tho iwani chaari unikoote no Ubethharamu, Ubethnimra, Usukothi ni Uzafoni, ni ilhapo yaahanlhe irii ya amwene Nasihoni o Uheshboni, yeyo ilhapo iyo yaari mpata uneelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni ukhalha mpata awe no nttiya no Ugalilaya. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Chechiyo iwani ni ittoko chiyo phi chiyo chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nagadi wo utwaraana ni mahimo aya.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwani chaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Namanase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Tho, ashinna Musa ahaavara inusu attu o nikosho ni Namanase wo utwaraana ni mahimo aya, <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />ilhapo uchokholha Mahanaimu mpaka ukelhelha ilhapo yonkhaye yaari ya amwene Naoga, Ubashani, vamoka ni iwani makhumi sita cho Yairi, <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />nusu yo Ugileadi, Uashtarothi, Uedrei, iwani yuulhupalhe yaakhalha aya amwene Naoga o Ubashani, mwommo mwonkhaye mmo aavahiye inusu ayari a Namakiri anaaya Namanase, wo utwaraana ni mahimo aya.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Chiichammo phi chenre aya ashinna Musa wo waamianihera ilhapo yo unoshelha nchuwa iwani yo Uyeriko ni Uyorodani, ikatema vaari aya ilhapo ihiri miako yo Umoabu. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Nansho ashinna Musa kaavahilhe attu o nikosho ni Alawi ilhapo iriyoothe. Yayo manyaattu ayo eerenlhe wiira vakittu yo yeyo inokhalha waakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ukawanihiya ilhapo yo Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Chilha phi ilhapo chaavahiye aya attu o Uisraeli wiilhaponi Ukanaani. opochera ishaani Naeliazari ni Nayoshua, anaaya Nanuni, vamoka ni aholhelhi o mahimo a attu o Uisraeli, ahaameelha attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Yaakawaninhe ilhapo chiyo wo woopiya ikhura thoko chaalhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wa ashinna Musa, wiira aavahe makosho tisa ni nusu alhe. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Ashinna Musa ari anaavahilhe makosho meelhi ni nusu ayo ilhapo aya yo unoosha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, nansho Aalawi khaavahiye ilhapo vamoka ni ayo. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Ayari a Nayusufu ari makosho meelhi: Namanase ni Naefraimu. Nikosho ni Alawi khanaavahiye mpata uriyoothe wo ilhapo, chaahikhalhe iwani cho ukhalha ni imata cho ulhihera mihuwo chaya, ni cho ulhima choolhia chaya. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Paahi etu, attu o Uisraeli ahomianiha ilhapo thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nakalebu anoovahiya iwani yo Uhebroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Nihuku nimoka, attu o nikosho ni Nayuda ahorwaa u Nayoshua Ugilgali uwo. Nakalebu anaaya Nayefune, ntu o Ukenizi, nkoolhumacha wa Nayoshua wo wiira, “Kinochuwelha wiira nnoowupuwelha Apwiiya Nlhuku cheerenlhe aya ashinna Musa, ntu a Nlhuku, mwaha unokaacha mii ni inyuva vaari ihu Ukadeshbarnea: <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Kaari ntu o malhipa o iyaakha makhumi ncheshe, ashinna Musa, karumiya a Nlhuku vaakirumilhe aya ukhuma Ukadeshbarnea, wiira kirwee kahotelhe ilhapo. Vaahokolhelhe aka, kahaahimeria mwaha unaacha wowo, thoko chaachuwelha aka munrimani waka, <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />uno ashikhunanaka aattukanne aka alhe aahelhaka attu ichuku cho ukwiilha mirima, nansho mii kahaatwara Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku aka wo nrima wo ukhulhuvelhiya. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, ashinna Musa ahokilhupelhelha wo wiira, ‘Wo ikekhiaye, ilhapo inyikanlhe inyu iyo inokhalha yawinyu, vamoka ni achishana inyu, mahuku o uhimalha. Ukhalhawaya nhooniha nrima wo ukhulhuvelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu’. <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Nansho vano mwooneke etu! Chihophiya iyaakha makhumi ncheshe ni nthanu, toka Apwiiya Nlhuku volhumanne aya ashinna Musa, mahuku attu o Uisraeli vaari aya munkwahani uthakoni. Toka vavawo, Apwiiya Nlhuku vaalhenhe aya, ahokishunga kirii nkumi mpaka lhelho nna, ni vano mii ki ntu o iyaakha makhumi nane ni nthanu. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Naansho ihinaya ki ntu o machiri thoko vaari aka ikatema yaakirumme aya ashinna Musa. Ata vano nna, kihanaa machiri o wooria waatakana ikhoto ama o uvara ntheko nkina uriyoothe. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Vano etu, kinolhepelha wiira nkivaheke ilha ilhapo yo miako ilha, yaakilhenhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, nenne nihuku nne. Inyuva mwaanene mwaheewa nenne nihuku nne wiira, Aanaki aakhalhacha wowo, wi iwani chirukurerihiye mangome; veekinaka etu, Apwiiya Nlhuku anokihoolhelha, ni mii kinokowoomolhacha thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chenre aya wo wulhumacha.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Phi vavawo Nayoshua vaavanhe aya ibarakha Nakalebu anaaya Nayefune ni waavaha iwani yo Uhebroni ukhalha yawaya. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Paahi etu, iwani yo Uhebroni phi yawaya achishana a Nakalebu anaaya Nayefune, ntu o Ukenizi mpaka lhelho nna, ukhalhawaya Nakalebu ahooniha nrima wo ukhulhuvelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli wo nrima awe wonkhaye. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Iwani yo Uhebroni khalhai vawo yeehaniya Kiriatharba. Maana aya iwani yo Ariba. Naarba ari ntu o uchuwania waapwaha attu onkhaye munlhokoni mwa Aanaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Ilhapo yonkhaye nkayaakhalha umpuhani, wo uhaatakaniya ikhoto.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o Uyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Ilhapo yaavahiye aya attu wo woopelhiya ikhura, attu o nikosho ni Nayuda wo ulhikaana ni mahimo aya, naawanenlhe ukhuma uchawa unoosha nchuwa mpaka umwiinanoni ni Uedomu. Mpata wo uchawa waari uthako wo Usini. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Mwiinano wo uchawa waari mpata wo uchawa wo ibahari yo Maakha, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />nkawaarwaa uchawa mpaka mwaako wo Ukrabimu, nkawaavira mwiinano wo Usini, ni uchawa wo Ukadeshbarnea, nkawaapwaha Uhesroni mpaka Uadari ni umalhelha wo urukunuwa ulhukama Ukarka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Uthana vavawo wahovira vakhiviru ni Uasmoni ni utwara nshepa no Umisri mpaka uphiya ubaharini yo Umediteraniya. Vavawo phi vaavinre mwiinano wo uchawa wo Uyuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Mwiinano waya wo mpata wo unoosha nchuwa waari Ibahari yo Maakha mpaka mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, vanokelha maashi ubaharini ni mpatta o mi mwiinano wo mpa. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Yoyo mwiinano uyo wahovira Ubethihogla ni uchulhu wo Ubeth araba mpaka waari nlhuku ni Nabohani naaya Narobeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Ukhuma vavawo, mwahorwaa mpaka Udebiri unikoote no Uakori ni uchulhu ulhukama Ugilgali, waari vakhiviru ni mwaako wo Uadumimu, waari uchawa wo nshepa, nkawaarwaa tho marapo o Uenshemeshi, nkawavira mpaka Uenrogeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Wamalheke vavawo, mwiinano uyo wahovira u Nikoote no Uhinomu, mpata wo uchawa wo mwaako wo Uyebusi, yaani Uyerusalemu, ulhukama mwaako waari uneelha nchuwa wo nikoote no Uhinomu ni uphiya unomalhelha nikoote no Urefaimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Ukhuma vavawo, mwahorwaa umiakoni mpaka marapo o Uneftoa, mpaka iwani cho umiakoni cho Uefroni. Vavawo, mwiinano wahorukunuwa ni ulhukama Ubaala, yaani Ukiriathyearimu, <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />waakhuruthuwilhe aya uneelha nchuwa ulhukama mwaako wo Useiri; nkawaavira mpata wo uchulhu wo mwaako wo Uyerimu, yaani Ukesaloni, ni ukhuruwa mpaka Ubethshemeshi, nkawaavira vakhiviru ni Utimna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Yamalheke, mwahorwaa mpata wo uchulhu wo Uekroni, nkawaarukureria ulhukama Ushikroni waavinre aya vakhiviru ni mwaako wo Ubaala mpaka Uyabneeli, nkawaamalhelha u Ibahari yo Umediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Mwiinano wo uneelha nchuwa waari ibahari yo Umediteraniya. Phi chiichammo chaari aya miinano cho ilhapo chaavahiye aya attu no nikosho ni Nayuda wo utwaraana ni mahimo aya.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attu a Nakalebu anoovarelha iwani yo Uhebroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Nakalebu anaaya Nayefune, aavahiye nhina ilhapo yo Uyuda thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa. Aavahiye iwani yo yenreenlhe Nayoshua. ahovahiya iwani i Naarba ari anokhalha apwiiya aya Aanaki. Yeyo iwani iyo vano ineehaniya iwani yo Uhebroni. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Nakalebu ahoomolhacha attu o makosho mararu a Aanaki yaani nihimo ni Nasheshai, nihimo ni Naahimani ni nihimo ni Natalmai, wowo wiilhaponi uwo. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Ukhuma Uhebroni ahorwaa ni waatakacha attu aakhalhacha Udebiri, iwani yeehaniya khalhai vawo iwani yo Ukiriathseferi. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Nakalebu nkayoolhumacha wiira, anonvekiha wa mwaamwanaya mwanthiyana, Aksa, wa nlhopwana riyoothe nohalha uvara mateeka iwani yo Ukiriath eferi. <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Paahi, Othnieli, mwaana a Nakenazi, ahima aya Nakalebu, nkaavara mateeka yeyo iwani yo, ni Nakalebu ahonvekiha mwaamwanaya mwanthiyana uyo. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Nihuku no ukelhiya arusi nno, Aksa ahomwiirelha Othnieli wiira avekelheke imata u Nakalebu. Aksa uyo ari nawenlhe iphuta, ni vaari awe akhuruwaka vathi, Nakalebu yahonkoha, “Nnothanana kuuvaheke ittu yaani?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Aksa nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Nkivaheke izawadi; nkivaheke imata yo maashi, ukhalhawaya Unegebu ukivahilhe binyu uwo, khaawo maashi.” Paahi etu, Nakalebu nkammaha marapo o maashi ari umiakoni ni o vathi waya.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwani cho Uyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Ilha phi ilhapo yaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nayuda wo ulhikaana ni mahimo aya. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Iwani chaari mpata wo uchawa chinene, wo ilhapo yo Uyuda unolhukama mwiinano wo Uedomu chaari: Ukabseeli, Uederi, Uyaguri, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Ukina, Udimona, Uadada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Ukedeshi, Uhazori, Uithnani, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Uzifu, Utelemu, Ubealothi, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Uhazorhadata, Ukeriothhezroni (yaani Uhazori), <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Uamamu, Ushema, Umolada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Uhasargada, Uheshmoni, Ubethpeleti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Uhasarshuali, Ubeersheba, Ubiziothia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Ubaala, Uiyimu, Uezemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Ueltoladi, Ukesili, Uhorima, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Usiklagi, Umadmana, Usansana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Ulebaothi, Ushilhimu, Uaini ni Urimoni. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari makhumi meelhi ni tisa vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Iwani chaari uhiri miako chaari: Ueshtaoli, Usora, Uashna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Uzanoa, Uenganimu, Utapua, Uenamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Uyarmuthi, Uadulamu, Usoko, Uazeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Ushaaraimu, Uadithaimu, Ugedera ni Ugederothaimu. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni ncheshe vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Ahovahiya tho iwani cho Usenani, Uhadasha, Umigdalgadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Udileani, Umizpa, Uyoktheeli, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Ulakishi, Uboskathi, Uegloni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Ukaboni, Ulahmamu, Ukithlishi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Ugederothi, Ubethdagoni, Unaama ni Umakeda. Jumla ya miji chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni sita vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Tho, ahovahiya iwani cho Ulibna, Uetheri, Uashani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Uyifta, Uashna, Unezibu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Ukeila, Uakizibu ni Umaresha. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari tisa vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Chiichammo tho ahovahiya Uekroni vamoka ni iwani chaya chikani ni ittoko, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />iwani chonkhaye ni ittoko chaari vakhiviru ni Uashdodi uriyari wo Uekroni ni ibahari.<verse eid="JOS 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Uashdodi ni Ugaza vamoka ni iwani ni ittoko chaya, mpaka nshepa no Umisri mpaka imbwani yo ibahari yo Umediteraniya.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Iwani chaari umiakoni chaari, Ushamiri, Uyatiri, Usoko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Udana, Ukiriathsana yaani Udebiri, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Uanabu, Ueshtemoa, Uanimu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Ugosheni, Uholoni ni Ugilo. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni imoka vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Ahovahachiya tho iwani cho Uaraba, Uduma, Ueshani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Uyanimu, Ubethtapua, Uafeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Uhumta, Ukiriatharba yaani Uhebroni ni Usiori. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari tisa vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Tho ahovahiya iwani cho Umaoni, Ukarmeli, Uzifu, Uyuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Nayezreeli, Uyokdeamu, Uzanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Ukaini, Ugibea ni Utimna. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari khumi vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Tho, ahovahiya iwani cho Uhalhuli, Ubethsuri, Ugedori, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Umaarathi, Ubethanothi ni Ueltekoni. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari sita vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Tho chiicho ahovahiya iwani cho Baali, uneehaniya tho Yearimu, ni Uraaba. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari piilhi vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Iwani cho uthakoni chaari Ubetharaba, Umidini, Usekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Unibshani, Iwani yo Maakha, ni Uengedi. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari sita vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Nansho attu o Uyuda khayoonrie woomolha Ayebusi, anenchi o iwani yo Uyerusalemu, ni mpaka lhelho nna, Ayebusi baado anokhalhacha vavawo vamoka ni attu o nikosho ni Nayuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo i Naefraimu ni i Namanase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Ilhapo yaameelhiye ayari o nikosho ni Nayusufu wo woopelhiya ikhura nachokhonlhe vakhiviru mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, unosha nchuwa nrapo no Uyeriko, ni uvira uthakoni, mpaka miako cho Ubetheli. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Ukhuma Ubetheli mwiinano waholhukama Uluzu nkawaavira Uatarothi waakhalha aya Aarki. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Nkawaakhuruwa uneelha ilhapo ya Ayafleti mpaka Ubethhoroni wo vathi ni Ugezeri ni umalhelha ibahari yo Umediteraniya.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Ayari a Nayusufu, yaani nikosho ni Namanase ni nikosho ni Naefraimu, ahovahiya yeyo ilhapo iyo ukhalha yawaya.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo ya attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu wo ulhikaana ni imbumba chaya aapante ilhapo, mwiinano aya wo unosha nchuwa uviraka Uatarothadari mpaka Ubethhoroni yo Uchulhu, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />ni umalhelha ibahari yo Umediteraniya. Mpata wo uchulhu waavinre Umikmethathi, ni unoshelha aya nchuwa wahorukureria ni ulhukama Utaana thshilo, waavinre aya unosha nchuwa Uyanoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Ukhuma Uyanoa mwahorwaa mpaka Uatarothi ni Unaara, nkawaaphiya Uyeriko, waamalhenlhe aya umwoolhokoni Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Ukhuma Utapua, mwiinano mwahorwaa uneelha nchuwa mpaka nshepa no Ukana ni umalhelha ibahari yo Umediteraniya. Yeyo phi ilhapo yaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu wo ulhikaana ni imbumba chaya. <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />vamoka ni iwani ni ittoko chonchereriye Naefraimu aya ukhuma ilapo yo nikosho no Namanase. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu khayoonrie woomolha attu o Ukanaani aakhalhacha Ugezeri. Yayo attu o Ukanaani ayo ahothepa ukhalha munlhokoni mwa attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu mpaka llhelho nna, akhalhe ipotta cho uvara mitheko chaya cho ukhanyererihiya.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s1">Uneelhelha nchuwa ilhapo yo Umanase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Attu o nikosho ni Namanase ari nttara ni Nayusufu, ni ayo ahovahachiya ilhapo yo ukhalha wo woopelhiya ikhura. Namakiri o nttara ni Namanase ari athumwanaya Nagileadi, ahomalha uvahiya iwani yo Ugileadi ni Ubashani, ukhalhawaya ari ntu o wiilhipa ukhotoni. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Attu akina o nikosho ni Namanase aahanlhe, ahovahiya ilhapo aya wo woopelhiya ikhura, wo ulhikaana ni mahimo aya. Yayo mahimo ayo ari a Naabiezeri, Naheleki, Nasrieli, Nashekemu, Naheferi ni Nashemida ari onkhaye ari mattara ashilhopwana a Namanase anaya Nayusufu.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Nansho Naselofehadi anaya Naheferi, anaaya Nagileadi, anaaya Namakiri, anaaya Namanase, khayaari ni achishana ashilhopwana, nansho arii ni achishana ashithiyanaru, ni ayo ari Mahla, Noa, Hogla, Milka ni Tirza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Yayo achishana ashithiyana ayo ahowa wa opochera ishaani Naeleazari ni Nayoshua, anaya Nanuni, ni wa aholhelhi akina ni weerelha, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaalhehera ashinna Musa wiira animeelhe ni hii onkhaye ilhapo thoko chinomeelhiya aya manyaalhopwana o nikosho ihu.” Paahi wo ulhikaana ni malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nayoshua ahaavahacha ilhapo thoko chaavahiye aya manyaalhopwana o nikosho naya. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Nkutiro u Namanase naari mipatta khumi ni mika yo ilhapo yaani ilhapo yo Ugileadi ni yo Ubashani irii ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />ukhalhawaya achishana ashithiyana a Namanase ahomeelhachiya vakittu waya thoko chaameelhiye aya manyaalhopwana o nikosho naya. Ilhapo yo Ugileadi ahovahiya achishana akina a Namanase.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Ilhapo yo nikosho ni Namanase naachokhonlhe Uasheri ni urwaa mpaka Umikmethathi unosha nchuwa Ushekemu, tho mwiinano aya mwahorwaa uchawa mpaka ilhapo yaakhalha ya attu o Uentapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Ilhapo yo Utapua yaari i Namanase, nansho iwani yo Tapua, yo umwiinanoni, yaari ya achishana a Naefraimu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Mwiinano wa Manase uyo ahothepa urwaa mpaka nshepa no Ukana. Iwani chaari mpata wo uchawa wo Ukana chaari cha Aefraimu inakhalhaka chaari mwiilhaponi mwa attu o nikosho ni Namanase. Tho, mwiinano wahovira uchulhu wo nshepa no Ukana ni umalhelha ibahari yo Umediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Ilhapo yo mpata wo uchawa yaari ya attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu, ni ilhapo no uchulhu nari na attu o nikosho ni Namanase, mwiinano aya ukhalhaka ibahari yo Umediteraniya, wo mpata uneelha nchuwa. Attu o nikosho ni Naasheri naakhalha uneelha nchuwa wo nikosho ni Namanase, ari attu o nikosho ni Naisakari mpata unosha nchuwa naari nikosho ni Naisakari. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Thothoni tho, mwiilhaponi mwa attu o nikosho ni Naisakari ni nikosho ni Naasheri, attu o nikosho ni Namanase ahovahiya iwani cho Ubetisheani ni Uibleamu vamoka ni ittoko chaya, ni iwani cho Udori, Ugedori, Naanaki ni Umegido vamoka ni anenchi ni ittoko chaya, tho, mpata mmoka wo mipatta miraru cho Unafathi. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Nansho achishana a Namanase khayoonrie woomolhacha anenchi aakhalhacha chechiyo iwani chiyo, attu o Ukanaani nkayaathepa ukhalha mwommo, <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />inakhalhaka ata baada yo attu o Uisraeli ukhalha ni machiri chinene, khayoonrie woomolha Akaanani kila nansho waavariha ntheko wo waakhanyereriha.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Attu o nikosho ni Nayusufu anookhota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Paahi attu o nikosho ni Nayusufu ahorwaa wa Nayoshua ni weerelha, “Chani woonaka nnimenlhe mpata mmoka etu wo ilhapo hii nivahiye ibarakha ni Apwiiya Nlhuku va, ata nkaanipanga ukhalha attu enchi?”<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Nayoshua nkaakhulha wo wiira, “Yakhalhaka nhenchiva thoko chiicho, ata ilhapo yo miako cho Efraimu khinoothoshani tho, paahi nrweeke etu mwiithuphini ilhapo ya attu o Uperizi ni ya Arefai, mwawuheke yeyo ithuphi iyo, mweesheke mapuro inyu wowo.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Ni ayo nkayaakhulhacha wo wiira, “Eiyo, wo ikekhiaye ilhapo yo miako ilha khinonithosha, ata inakhalhaka chiicho etu, attu o Ukanaani onkhaye anokhalhacha ilhapo yo uhikhalhe miako ahanaa nkukuta cho yuuma, tho, onkhaye anokhalhacha Ubethsheani vamoka ni iwani chaya, ni alhe anokhalhacha nikoote no Nayezreeli.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Paahi, Nayoshua aheerelha achishana a Nayusufu, yaani attu o nikosho ni Naefraimu ni Namanase wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye mwaatti nhenchiva ni o ikuru yulhupalhe. khavanlhoka wiira mpatte vakittu vamoka etu. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />Nansho tho, ilhapo yo umiakoni inokhalha yawinyu. Inakhalhaka vano iri ithuphiru, mwooheke ni uvarelha ukhalha yawinyu, toka ulha mpata ulha mpaka mpata nkina. Mwoomolhacheke attu o Ukanaani, ata anakhalhaka ihaana nkukuta cho yuuma ni attu o machiri.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">Makosho makina anomeelhiya ilhapo yaahalhenlhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Baada yo ukottolha ilhapo ilhe, nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Uisraeli wahokumaana Ushilo uwo ni weemesha Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Nansho ahokhalha makosho saba ari ahinameelhiya ilhapo aya. <verse eid="JOS 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Paahi etu, Nayoshua aheerelha attu o Uisraeli wiira, “Chani, nhocherewa mpaka iyaakha wo uhirwaaka ukhalhelhani ilhapo ivahiye inyu ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a manyaapwiiya inyu ilhe? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Nthanlheke attu araru ukhuma kila nikosho, kaarume mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye ahotelhe ni ulhepa iramani wo ulhikaana ni makosho aya, amalhihaka awe aakihimeria. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Ni ayo amianiheke ilhapo iyo mipatta saba. Nikosho ni Nayuda nihalheke ni mpata aya wo uchawa, ni nikosho ni Nayusufu mpata aya wo uchulhu. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Nlhepeke mwaha unaacha mipatta chonkhaye saba ni ukiwiihera. Vavawo kinowa woopa ikhura umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, kichuwelhe mwaha unaacha mpata wo kila nikosho. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Nansho Alawi khanovahiya mpata uriyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu, ukhalhawaya mpata aya phi ukhalha opochera ishaani o waakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku. Makosho a Nagadi, Narobeni ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase yayo ahomalha upatta mipatta chaya, unosha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Aavahiye wowo ni ashinna Musa, karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Paahi, yayo attu ayo ahochokholha nkwaha wo urwaa uhotelhani ilhapo. Nansho ahinaaya uthama, Nayoshua ahaalhehera wiira, “Nrweeke mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye mwalhepe mwaha wo chittu cho ilhapo iyo, mwamalhihaka nhokolhieke mmwe mwaakihimeria, ni mii kinowoopa ikhura umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku vava va Shilo va, kichuwelhe mipatta chinohalha inyu uvahiya.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Manyaalhopwana ayo nkayaathama ni urukureriya ilhapo yonkhaye, nkayaalhepa mwaha unaacha mipatta chaya saba vamoka ni iwani chaya, amalhiheru ahohokolhia u Nayoshua unipuroni Ushilo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Wowo Ushilo uwo etu, Nayoshua ahoopelha ikhura chechiyo mipatta chiyo umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkaameelhacha attu o Uisraeli, kila nikosho ni mpata aya.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Ikhura yo upacha yaapante attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini wo ulhikaana ni mahimo aya. Ilhapo yaavahiye aya yayo attu ayo yaari iriyari yo nikosho ni Nayuda ni nikosho ni Nayusufu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Mwiinano aya wo uchulhu waachokholhenlhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni uvira uchulhu wo Uyeriko ni ilhapo yo miako ulhukamaka uneelha nchuwa mpaka uthako wo Ubethaveni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Uthama vavawo, mwiinano uyo mwahorwaa uchawa wo Uluzu, yaani Ubetheli, mpaka Uatarothadari, umwaako uri uchawa wo Ubethhoroni yo vathi. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Mpata uneelha nchuwa ukhuma mwaako unoweehana iwani Ubethoroni mpata o uchawa mpaka wahorukunuwa ukelha yoyo iwani ina Benyamini phi waari mwiinano aya wo mpata uneelha nchuwa. ni uphiya iwani Ukriathyearimu, iwani ya attu o nikosho ni Nayuda. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Mpata uneenlhe uchawa ni ukhuma urii mwaako inoweeha iwani yo Ukiri mpata o uchawa mwiinano urukunuwe waviraka nchereshere wo ilhapo i Nabenyamini ni upiya Ukiriath ibahahari yaari iwani ya attu o Uyuda. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Yamalheke wahokhuruwa uvirelha nchereshere mwaako uri vakhiviru ni nikoote no mwaamwanaya Nahinomu, naari mpata wo uchulhu chinene wo nikoote na Arefai. Tho, mwiinano wahokhuruwa ukelha nikoote no Uhinomu, uchawa waari mwaako wa Ayebusi, nkawaathepa ukhuruwa mpaka Uenrogeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Wowo, miinano wahorukunuwa uuchulhu ni ukelha Uenshemeshi, nkawaavira Ugelilothi unowehana mwamwako wo Uadumimu ni ukhuruwa mpaka waari nlhuku ni Nabohani anaaya Robeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Wo uthama vavawo, mwiinano wahorukunuwa uchulhu wo Uaraba ni umalhelha Uaraba uwo. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Tho, ahothepa urwaa mpata wo uchulhu wo mwaako wo Ubethhogla ni umalhelha uchulhu chineneni wo Ibahari yo Maakha, vakittu vanokelha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. yoyo phi mwiinano wo mpata wo uchawa. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani waari phi mwiinano aya wo mpata wo uneelha nchuwa. Phi chiichammo etu cheesheriye aya miinano mahimo a attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Iwani cho mahimo a attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini chaari; Uyeriko, Ubethhogla, Uemekkesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Ubetharaba, Uzemaraimu, Ubetheli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Uavimu, Upara, Uofra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Ukefar Naamoni, Uofni ni Ugebai. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni piilhi vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Iwani chikina chaari; Ugibeoni, Uraama, Ubealothi, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Umizpa, Ukefar, Umoza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Urekemu, Uirpeeli, Utarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Uzela, Uhelefu, Uyebusi, yaani Uyerusalemu, Ugibea ni Ukiriathyearimu. Jumla yo iwani chaavahiye aya chaari khumi na ncheshe vamoka ni ittoko chaya. Chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo phi mipatta cho ilhapo chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ni mahimo aya.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nasimeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Ikhura yo nayelhi yaapante attu o nikosho ni Nasimeoni ni mpata wo ilhapo aya waarukurerie ni ilhapo ya attu o nikosho ni Nayuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Attu o nikosho ni Nasimeoni aapante iwani cho Ubeersheba, Usheba, Umolada <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Uhasarshuali, Ubala, Uesemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Ueltoladi, Ubethuli, Uhorima, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Usiklagi, Ubethmarkabothi, Uhasarsusa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Ubeth lebaothi ni Usharuheni. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni ttaru vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Tho wahokhalha iwani cho enrimoni, Uaini Uetheri, ni Uashani. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari ncheshe vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Vamoka ni iwani chonkhaye ni ittoko chonkhaye chinorukureria iwani mpaka Ubaalathbeeri, ama Uraama, yo Unegebu. Chonkhaye chiyo phi chaari ilhapo chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nasimeoni. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Ukhalhawaya vakittu velhapo yaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nayuda yaari yulhupalhe upwaha nikosho nno chaathanana aya, ilhapo aya aavahiye nikosho ni Nasimeoni.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Nazabuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Ikhura yo neraru yaapante attu o nikosho ni Nazabuloni. Ilhapo aya yahowanelha mpaka Usaridi. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Ukhuma wowo mwiinano aya mwahorwaa uneelha chuwa mpaka Umareali, nkawaavira vachereshere mwo Udabeshethi ni urwaa nshepa niri unosha nchuwa Uyokneamu. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Ukhuma Usaridi, mwiinano uyo waakenlhe unosha nchuwa mpaka mwiinano wo Ukisloth tabori, ni uthama vavawo waavinre Udaberathi mpaka Uyafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Ukhuma Uyafia mwiinano mwahorwaa unosha nchuwa mpaka Ugath heferi, Ueth kasini, ni uthepa mpaka Urimoni waawenlhe aya mpaka Unea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Mpata wo uchulhu mwiinano wahorukunuwa ukelha Uhanathoni ni umalhelha nikoote no Uyiftaheli. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Nkawaathakaniha iwani cho Ukatathi, Unahalali, Ushimroni, Uyidala ni Ubeth lehemu. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni piilhi vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Chechiyo phi mipatta chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nazabuloni, iwani vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Naisakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Ikhura yo necheshe yaapante attu o nikosho ni Naisakari. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Ilhapo inene iyo yaari iwani cho Nayezreeli, Ukesulothi, Ushunemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Uhafaraimu, Ushioni, Unaharathi, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Urabithi, Ukishioni, Uebesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Uremethi, ganimu, Uen hada ni Ubethpasesi. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Thothoni tho, mwiinano aya wahophiya Utabori, Ushahasuma, Ubeth shemeshi ni umalhelha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni sita vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Chechiyo phi ilhapo chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Naisakari, iwani vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Naasheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Ikhura yo nethanu yaapante attu o nikosho ni Naasheri. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Ilhapo aya yaari iwani cho Uhelkathi, Uhali, Ubeteni, Uakshafi, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Ualameleki, Uamadi ni Umishali. Mpata uneelha nchuwa mwiinano wahophiya mwaako o Ukarmeli ni Ushihorlibnathi. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Yamalheke wahorukunuwa ukelha unosha nchuwa urwaa Ubeth dagoni waavaranne ni Uzebuloni ni nikoote no Uiftaheli. Tho, nkawaarwaa mpata wo uchulhu mpaha Ubeth emeki, Uneieli ni uthepa urwaa mpata wo uchulhu mpaka Ukabuli, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Uhebroni, Urehobu, Uhamoni, Ukana mpaka Usidoni Wulhupalhe. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Vavawo, mwiinano wahorukunuwa ukelha Uraama ni ulhiya iwani yo Utiro yaarukureriye ni ingome. Nkawaarukunuwa ukelhelha Uhosa ni umalhelha ibahari yo Umediteraniya. Iwani chikina chaari Umaharabu, Uakizibu, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Uuma, Uafeka ni Urehobu. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari makhumi meelhi ni piilhi vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Chechiyo ilhapo chiyo phi chiyo chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Naasheri, iwani chiyo vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Nanaftali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Ikhura yo sita yaapante attu o nikosho ni Nanaftali. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Mwiinano aya waachokholhenlhe Uhelefu ni mwiri muulhupalhe u Nazananimu, nkawaavira Uadami nekebu ni Uyabneeli mpaka Ulakumu ni umalhelha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Uthama vavawo mwiinano mwahorwaa uneelha nchuwa ulhukama Uaznoth tabori, ni toka wowo nkawaarwaa Uhakoki ni uvaraana ni mpata wo uchawa wo ilhapo ya attu o nikosho ni Nazabuloni, nkawavaraana ni ilhapo yo attu o nikosho ni Naasheri wo mpata uneelha nchuwa, ni uvaraana ni ilhapo ya attu o Uyuda. Mpata unosha nchuwa mwiinano wahokelha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Iwani chaya chaarukureriye ni ingome chaari, Uzidimu, Uzeri, Uhamathi, Urakathi, Ukinerethi, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Uadama, Uraama, Uhazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Ukedeshi, Uedrei, Uen Uhazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Uyironi, Umigdaleli, Uhoremu, Ubeth anathi ni Ubeth shemeshi. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari tisa vamoka ni ittoko chaya. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Chechiyo phi iwani chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Nanaftali iwani vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilhapo yaavahiye attu o nikosho ni Naphtali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Ikhura yo saba yaapante attu o nikosho ni Unadani. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Ilhapo aya yaari ni iwani cho Usora, Ueshtaoli, Uirshemeshi <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Ushaalabini, Uaiyaloni, Uyithla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Ueloni, Utimna, Uekroni <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Uelteke, Ugibethoni, Ubaalathi, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Uyehudi, Ubene beraki, Ugathrimoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Umeyarkoni ni Urakoni ni ilhapo yaari vakhiviru ni Uyopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Attu o nikosho ni Unadani koriyaalhe ukusha ilhapo yaavahiye, ahorwaa ni ukelhelha iwani yo Uleshemu. Nkayaakottolha ni uvara mateeka, ni baada yo weevakacha attu aakhalha mwommo ayo onkhaye, ahokusha iwani iyo ni unvaha nchina no naanano ukhalha iwani yo Urdani; nchina naari na apwiiya aya. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Chechiyo phi ilhapo chaavahiye aya attu o nikosho ni Unadani, iwani vamoka ni ittoko chaya.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umeelhaniya ilhapo wo umalhelha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Vaamalhinhe aya umeelhana ilhapo yonkhaye, attu o Uisraeli ahaavara Nayoshua, anaaya Nanuni, mpata aya variyari aya. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Wo ulhikaana ni malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku ahovahiya ilhapo yaathanlhilhe aya Nayoshua, yaani iwani yo Utimnath sera, yaari wi ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Efraimu. Ni Nayoshua ahotheka tho yeyo iwani iyo ni ukhalha mwommo.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Paahi, opochera ishaani Naeleazari ni Nayoshua, anaaya Nanuni, vamoka ni manyaaholhelhi o makosho a attu o Uisraeli ahomianiha mipatta cho ilhapo chiyo wo woopelhiya ikhura umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, vanlhakoni wo Nihema Nitakatifu Ushilo uwo. Paahi nkayaamalhiha ukawaniha ilhapo.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">Iwani cho uttawelha ni wiichakiha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku aheerelha Nayoshua, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />wiira aahimeriache attu o Uisraeli cho, “mwiichereke iwani i chinohalha awe ntu uttawelha wiira aakihe ukumi awe, thoko cherenlhe aka ashinna Musa wiira ohimerieni. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />ntu riyoothe amwiivaka ntu wo uhilhakelha, nowooria uttawelha imoka yo chechiyo iwani chiyo ni unttawa ntu ri ntheko wo ulhivihera iphome ya mmuchi awe iriheelhe. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Ntu eevilhe uyo attawelheke iwani imoka aya, ni weemelha vanlhakoni vo ukelhelha iwani, ni waahimiachera ashulhupalhe o iwani iyo nlhatu awe. Ashulhupalhe ayo anompochera ni ummaha vakittu wo unkhalhana. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Ntu o ulhivihera antwaraka mpaka wowo i iwani uwo, ashulhupalhe o iwani iyo ahinkumihe ntu eevilhe uyo wa yoyo ntu o ulhivihera uyo, ukhalhawaya aamwiivilhe nkhunanawe uyo uhilhakelha, ni ayo khayaari ni indewo mpacho vaa. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Ntu eevilhe uyo athepeke ukhalha wowo mpaka vanohalha awe urweehiya umilhatuni ni uhukumulhiya umihoolho wa nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Uisraeli, ni tho mpaka opochera ishaani olhupalhe ari uhicheni vanohalha aya urimeelha. Baada yo vavawo ntu uyo nowooria uhokolhia uwannyawe waattawilhe awe uwo.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Paahi, wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, waheeshiya iwani cho Ukedeshi ilhapo yo Ugalilaya umwaakoni Unaftali, Ushekemu uri miako cho Efraimu ni Ukiriath arba yaani Uhebroni ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Uyuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, mpata unosha nchuwa Uyeriko, yaathanlhe iwani yo Ubezeri iri uthako wo uhikhalhe miako, ni iwani inene iyo inokhalhiya ni attu o nikosho ni Narobeni. Tho, ahonthanlha iwani yo Uramothi ilhapo yo Ugileadi, iwani ya attu o nikosho ni Nagadi ni Ugolani, ilhapo yo Ubashani ilhapo ya attu o nikosho ni Namanase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Chilha phi iwani cheeshiye wo nlhatu no attu onkhaye o Uisraeli ni alheto aakhalhacha munlhokoni mwaya, wiira ntu riyoothe nohalha umwiiva nkhunanawe wo uhilhakelha attawelhe wowo hiwe eeviya ni ntu o ulhivihera iphome irihelhe, mpaka vavawo vanohalha awe uhukumulhiya umihoolho wo nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">Iwani cha Alawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Vaari aya Ushilo ilhapo yo Ukanaani aholhelhi o mahimo a Alawi ahorwaa wa opochera ishaani Naeliazari ni u Nayoshua anaaya Nanuni, ni wa manyaaholhelhi akina cho makosho onkhaye a attu o Uisraeli, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />nkayeerelhacha wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaalhehera ashinna Musa wiira nivahiye iwani cho ukhalha ni imata cho ulhihera mihuwo chihu.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Paahi, wo ulhikaana ni malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku, attu o Uisraeli ahaavara ittu mwiilhaponi mwaya, iwani ni ittoko chaari ni imata cho ulhihera mihuwo, nkayaavahacha Alawi chikhalhe chawaya.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Ikhura yo upacha yaapante attu o nikosho ni Nakohathi. Mmilhokoni mwaya attu o iyari ya opochera ishaani Naharuni ahovahiya wo woopelhiya ikhura, iwani chaari mwiilhaponi mwa attu o makosho a Nayuda, Nasimeoni, ni Nabenyamini. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari khumi ni ttaru.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Attu o nikosho ni Nakohathi ahalhenlhe alhe aavahachiye iwani khumi chiri mwi ilhapo cha attu o makosho a Naefraimu, a Unadani ni vaari inusu yo nikosho ni Namanase.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Attu o nihimo ni Nagershoni ahovahiya wo woopelhiya ikhura iwani khumi ni ttaru mwiilhaponi mwa attu o makosho a Naisakari, Naasheri, Nanaftali ni ilhapo nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase, Ubashani uwo.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Attu o nihimo ni Namerari aavahachiye iwani khumi ni piilhi mwiilhaponi mwa attu o makosho a Narobeni, Nagadi ni Nazabuloni.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Attu o Uisraeli ahaavara Alawi chechiyo iwani chiyo vamoka ni iwani chaari ni imata cho uhuwelha mihuwo, thoko chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Alha anottwara alha phi machina o iwani cho ukhuma ilhapo cha attu o makosho a Nayuda ni Nasimeoni chaakumihiye wa <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />wo achishana a opochera ishaani Naharuni, ari ashilhoko aya attu o nihimo ni Nakohathi o nikosho ni Alawi. Ilhapo aya yaari yo upacha woopelhiya ikhura. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Aavahiye Ukiriath arba yaani Uhebroni, Naarba ari athumwanaya Naanaki, umiakoni Uyuda, vamoka ni ithuphi chaarukureria. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Nansho imata cho yeyo iwani iyo ni ittoko chaarukurenrie chahomalha uvahiya Nakalebu anaaya Nayefune chikhalhe chawaya.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Vamoka ni waavaha achishana a opochera ishaani Naharu iwani yo Uhebroni, yeeshiye wo nlhatu no uttawelha attu wiira eechakihe, ahaavaha iwani vamoka ni ilhapo yo Ulibna vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Uyatiri vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, Ueshtemoa vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Uholoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, Udebiri vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Uaini vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, Uyuta vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Ubeth shemeshi vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye ilhapo cho yayo makosho ayo meelhi ni tisa. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Mwiilhaponi mwa attu o nikosho ni Nabenyamini ahovahiya iwani chikina cho: Ugibeoni ni Ugebai vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Uanathothi vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, Ualmoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Iwani chonkhaye cha achishana a Naharuni ari opochera ishaani chaari khumi ni ttaru vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Attu o nihimo ni Nakohathi ahalhenlhe, ari tho ashilhoko a attu o makosho a Alawi ahovahachiya iwani mwi ilhapo yo nikosho ni Naefraimu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Aavahiye Ushekemu, uwani yaari tho phi iwani yo uttawelha ni wiichakiha, vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, yaari miako yo Efraimu, ni Ugezeri vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Ukibzaimu vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Ubeth horoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chavahiye aya chaari ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Mwiilhaponi mwa attu o nikosho ni Unadani aavahiye Uelteke vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, Ugibethoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Uaiyaloni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Ugath rimoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Wi ilhapo nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase aavahiye Naanaki vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Ugath rimoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari piilhi. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Paahi iwani chaavahiye aya ashilhoko a Nakohathi chaahalhenlhe, chaari khumi vamoka ni ithuphi chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Ashilhoko a Alawi, attu o mahimo a Nagershoni, aavahiye iwani piilhi ukhuma nusu yo ilhapo yo nikosho ni Namanase: Ugolani, Ubashani uwo, iwani yo uttawelhelha ni wiichakiha, vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Ubeesh tera vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Wiilhaponi mwo nikosho ni Naisakari, aavahiye Ukishioni vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, Udaberathi vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Uyarmuthi vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Uen ganimu vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Wiilhaponi wo nikosho ni Naasheri aavahiye Umishali vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, Uabdoni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Uhelkathi vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, ni Urehobu vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Wiilhaponi wa nikosho ni Nanaftali aavahiye Ukedeshi, uwani yo uttawelha ni wiichakiha irii Ugalilaya uwo, vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, Uhamoth dor vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Ukartani vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo. Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya chaari ttaru. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Jumla yo iwani cha ashilhoko a attu o nihimo ni Nagershoni chaari khumi ni ttaru, vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Alawi akina aahanlhe, yaani ayari a Namerari, aavahachiye iwani u nikosho ni Nazabuloni. Ni chiyo phi Uyokneamu vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, Ukarta vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Udimna vamoka ni imata chaya, ni Unahalali vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, jumla chaari iwani ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Attu o nikosho ni Narobeni aavahiye Ubezeri vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera, Uyahazi vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Ukedemothi vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, ni Umeafathi vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Jumla chaari iwani ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Wa attu o nikosho ni Nagadi, yayo aavahiye iwani yo Uramothi yo Ugileadi, iwani yo uttawelhelha ni wiichakiha, vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo, Mahanaimu vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Uheshboni vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera ni Uyazeri vamoka ni imata chaya cho ulhihera mihuwo. Jumla chaari iwani ncheshe. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya ayari a Namerari, yaani ashilhoko a Alawi chaahalhenlhe, chaari khumi ni piilhi.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Jumla yo iwani chonkhaye chaavahiye aya Alawi mwiilhaponi mwa Aisraeli chaari makhumi ncheshe ni nane, vamoka ni imata chaya cho uhuwelha mihuwo. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Kila imoka munlhokoni mwo chechiyo iwani chiyo, chaarukureriye ni imata cho ulhihera mihuwo.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attu o Uisraeli anookusha ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Paahi, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaavara attu o Uisraeli ilhapo yonkhaye yaalhenhe aya chalhupenlhe manyaapwiiya aya. Ni ayo ahovarelha ni ukhalha mwommo. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaavahacha mpuha kila vakittu mwiilhaponi mmo, thoko chaalhupenlhe aya manyaapwiiya aya. Khaariwo mmalhaponi riyoothe oonrie waatakana ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahomalha waakottolhelha yayo amalhaponi aya ayo. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />khawaariwo malhehano nirinoothe norera, naalhehilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wa attu o Uisraeli nahaatiminre. Malhehano onkhaye ahotimira.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Attu o makosho o unosha nchuwa anoohokolhiacha uwannyaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Paahi, Nayoshua aheehanacha attu o makosho a Narobeni, ni Nagadi ni attu nusu yo attu o nikosho ni East Namanase <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />nkayeerelha, “Mwaatti nhottwara malhove onkhaye a ashinna Musa, karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku, aalhehenre aya wiira mpange, nkamwaakirumelhelha. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Ni mena khamwaahiilhe ashilhoko inyu mahuku menchi onkhaye ayo mpaka lhelho nna, nansho nhottwara wo irusho malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Vano etu, Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu ahaavara ashilhoko inyu mpuha, thoko chenre aya wo ulheha. Paahi nhokolhieke etu umawannyu wiilhaponi mwaavahiye inyu ni ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku, ikhalhe yawinyu yaani ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Nhiishiuke, nvarechesheke malhehero a ashinna Musa karumiya a Apwiiya Nlhuku, chalhehenre aya wo wiira: Mwaattuneke Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, mpangeke ittu inothanana aya ni uvarechesha malhehero aya; wiira nhalhe vamoka ni ayo ni waakavihera wo nrima wonkhaye ni wo nnepa wonkhaye.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Paahi Nayoshua ahaavahacha ibarakha ni waahiya arwaache yeerelhaka, <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />“wo inusu nikosho ni Namanase ahovahiya yo bashani idhahabu, ishaaba, iyuuma ni ikuwo chinchi. Nkawanacheke ni ashilhoko inyu nhakhu mwaavanre inyu mateeka ukhuma wa amalhaponi inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 22:7">Ashinna Musa ari anaavahilhe nusu ya attu o nikosho ni Namanase ilhapo aya Ubashani uwo. <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />Ni ayo Nayoshua nkaavaha inusu yo nayelhi iyo nenno nikosho nno mpata aya uneelha nchuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani uwo, thoko chaavanhe aya attu o makosho makina alhe.<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Paahi, attu o nikosho ni Narobeni, Nagadi ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase ahomwalhaana ni attu o makosho makina a attu o Uisraeli wowo Ushilo uwo, Ukanaani, nkayaahokolhiacha uwannyaya, ilhapo yo Ugileadi, ilhapo aya ashinene, yaavahiye aya wo malhehero a Apwiiya Nlhuku thoko chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madhubahu o Uyorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Kaanyuma yo ikatema yo ilhapo ya Narubeni Nagadi ni inusu ina manase Geliloth mwoolhoko o Uyorodani anari baado wiilhaponi Ukanaani, ahotheka madhubahu molhupalhe chinene vakhiviru mwoolhoko uyo. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Paahi, nttenga nkawaaphiyelha attu o makosho makina a attu o Uisraeli wiira attu o makosho a Narobeni, Nagadi ni inusu yo nikosho ni Namanase ahotheka madhubahu molhupalhe vakhiviru mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ilhapo yo Ukanaani, yaani awehaka vakittu waya. <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Yeewekeru chiicho, attu o Uisraeli ahokumaana onkhaye Ushilo uwo wiira arwee aatakane ikhoto ni attu o yayo makosho o unosha nchuwa ayo.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Paahi attu o Uisraeli nkayaaruma Nafiniasi, anaaya opochera ishaani Naeleazari, Ugileadi uwo wa attu o makosho a Narobeni, Nagadi ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Nafiniasi ahothama vamoka ni ashulhupalhe khumi, kila mmoka nari o weemelhelha ashilhoko awe o unikoshoni wawe. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Ni ayo ahorwaa wa attu o makosho a Narobeni, Nagadi ni nusu yo nikosho ni East Namanase, Ugileadi uwo, ni weerelha wiira, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />nlhoko wonkhaye wa Apwiiya Nlhuku unokoha wiira, “Uthephiacha waani upangilhe inyu wa Nlhuku a ttu o israeli? Woonaka nhaahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku vathekilhe inyu alha madhubahu alha? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Chani, uwonya waawonyilhe ihu Peori khawaathoshilhe? Khannoona wiira baado khanineehapiha ni ntwarusho waya baado unoohiviha nlhoko wa Apwiiya Nlhuku? <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Chani etu, woonaka nhohiya utwara iphiro cha Apwiiya Nlhuku? Mwaahiyaka Apwiiya Nlhuku lhelho, meelho anoothunalhelha chinene nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Haya, yakhalhaka ilhapo inyun kinrumelhelhi aya, mmweeke etu wiilhaponi wa Apwiiya Nlhuku urii nihema naya, mmwe mwaakusha nipuro wowo vamoka ni hii, nansho etu nhaahiye Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uphanga hii onkhaye va noonie wiira nihaahiya wo utheka madhubahu ahiri a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Chani, Naakani anaaya Nazera vaattenke aya ni uhiya uvarechesha malheheriyo, urushiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku uwo khawawulhuwenlhe nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Uisraeli? Tho, Naakani khaakhwilhe vekha ayaru, wo nlhatu wo uwonya waya.”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Vavawo attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase yahaakhulha aashulhupalhe o milhoko cha attu o Uisraeli, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Nlhuku o milhuku phi Apwiiya Nlhuku! Nlhuku o milhuku phi Apwiiya Nlhuku! Yayo ahochuwelha nlhatu waani hii noopanga chommo. Ni attu o Uisraeli onkhaye ahochuwelha chiicho! Yakhalhaka chommo phi waahiya ama uhaarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi ahiyeke unookholha lhelho. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Yakhalha nihaahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku nkanaatheka madhubahu ihu naashinene wiira nikumihe isadaka cho upahiya mooro, cho choolhia ama cho uwiiha mpuha, paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku anilhivihereke. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Nansho kihena chiicho. Naathenke wo woova wiira veekinaka mahuku anowa ayo, achishana inyu anowaahimeria achishana ihu wiira, ‘Mwaatti khannothananiya waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Khannoona wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku aheesha mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ukhalhe mwiinano variyari ihu ni inyu mwaatti? Mwaatti o makosho a Narobeni ni o nikosho ni Nagadi khanrina nifungu nirinoothe nawinyu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.’ Paahi achishana inyu aanooria kaanyuma vawo waakukureha achishana ihu, nkayaahiya waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Phi nlhatu etu, nahotheka madhubahu alha, nansho kuhii wo nlhatu no ukumuhera vachulhu vawo isadaka wala uhelha ipepa, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />nansho naathananne madhubahu alha ahimiecheshe variyari ihu ni inyu mwaatti ni iyari chihu chinowa wiira hii nihanaa nipesha no uvara mitheko cha Apwiiya Nlhuku wo isadaka chihu cho upahiya mooro ni isadaka chihu chikina, ni wo isadaka chihu cho uwiiha mpuha, wiira achishana inyu ahiwe yeerelha achishana ihu wiira, khaarina nifungu nirinoothe nawaya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Tho, nahoopuwelha wiira yakhalhaka yoyo mwaha uyo woolhumelhelhi aka unaacha hii, ama wa achishana ihu mahuku anowa ayo, ninowa neera, ‘Mwooneke madhubahu a Apwiiya Nlhuku aathekilhe aya manyaapwiiya ihu; kuhii wo nlhatu no ukumihera vachulhu waya isadaka ama uhelha ipepa, nansho ukhalha phi uhimiechesha variyari ihu ni inyu mwaatti’. <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Hii khanaarina nnikwa wo waahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku, ata vakani, ni waahiya wo utheka madhubahu o ukumihera isadaka cho upahiya mooro ama isadaka cho ipepa ama cho ulhapelhelhiya. Khaninttuna ukumihera isadaka vakittu vakina yaahikhalhe vachulhu madhubahu a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu ari uholho wo nipuro naya.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Opochera ishaani Nafiniasi, ashulhupalhe o milhoko cha attu o Uisraeli vaari aya vawo, weewa aya malhove a attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase, nkayawoona. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Ni Nafiniasi anaaya opochera ishaani Naeliazari, nkayeerelha attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi ni nusu yo nikosho ni Namanase wiira, “Lhelho nihochuwelha wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku ari munlhokoni ukhalhawaya khanapangelhe Nlhuku. Vano nhookholha attu o Uisraeli wiira ahitwarushiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Paahi Nafiniasi anaaya opochera ishaani Naeliazari vamoka ni aholhelhi nanaya ahaakawaniha attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi nkayaathama wiilhaponi Ugileadi, nkayaahokolhia Ukanaani wa Aisraeli ni waahimeria mwaha uyo. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Yoyo mwaha uyo wahaateelhiha attu o Uisraeli, nkayaashukuru Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uhiya mwaha wo uthanana waatakana ikhoto, mwaha wo uthanana uhararia ilhapo ya attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Attu o makosho a Narobeni ni Nagadi nkayehana yayo madhubahu ayo, o “Uhimiechesha” kwaani yeera, “Madhubahu alha phi uhimiechesha wihu wonkhaye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku phi Nlhuku ihu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">Malhove o umalhihera a Nayoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Baada yo uvira mahuku menchi, Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaavahe attu o Uisraeli mpuha wo wookholha ukhuma wa amalhaponi aya o mipatta chonkhaye. yeyo ikatema iyo Nayoshua ari anolhuvanlhe, ntu o iyaakha chinchi. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Paahi aheehana attu o Uisraeli onkhaye vamoka ni manyaaholhelhi aya, attu o waamulha milhatu, ni attu o ipilhi, ni weerelha wiira, “Vano mii kiholhuvalha, ntu o iyaakha chinchi. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Ni inyu nhoona chittu chonkhaye cha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu chaapannge aya wa attu o makosho makina wo nlhatu winyu. Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu phi o wokhonlhaeni. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Ilhapo cha attu o makosho chihanlhe ni alhe kaarimelhinhe aka chikhalhe etu cha attu o makosho inyu, ukhuma Uyorodani mpaka ibahari yo Umediteraniya, mpata uneelha nchuwa. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, anowaathamihacha umihoolho winyu yayo attu ayo ni woomolha kabisa, ni inyu nnookhalhelha ilhapo aya thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku ayo chenre aya wo ulhehani. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Paahi etu, mwiilhipiheke nvarecheshaka malhove onkhaye alhepiye nhina ikitabu yo Malhehero a ashinna Musa, ni mena nhihiye yayo. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Vavawo nthakaanache ni attu o makosho ahalhenlhe munlhokoni mwinyu alha. Nhiromolhache milhuku chaya wala ulhupeha wo machina o milhuku chaya chiyo, nhikavihere ni mena nhikhoromelhe. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Nansho nvaraaneke ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu thoko chipannge inyu mpaka lhelho va. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahoomolhacha umihoolho winyu makosho molhupalhe ni o machiri, ni khaawo ntu oonrie uuvingani mwaatti mpaka lhelho nna. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Ntu mmoka o munlhokoni mwinyu vekha awe nowooria waatopora amalhaponi elufu imoka, kwaani Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu phi nowinkelhani thoko chenre aya wo ulhehani. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Paahi etu, nkhalheke miitho chinene ni waattuna Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Ukhalhawaya, yakhalhaka mwahaahiyaka Apwiiya Nlhuku ni ulhutaana ni alha makosho ahalhenlhe munlhokoni mwinyu alha, nkamwaavekacha ni ayo nkayaawa ni waaveka attu o uwaninyu, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />nchuwelheke wo ikekhiaye wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu khanothepa woomolhacha makosho alha umihoolho winyu, nansho makosho ayo anookhalha phi ittu yo uhuvihani, nrianko wo uwayihani. Anookhalha ikopo yo uwaatakachani, ni mwiiwa cho uhomani mmiithoni mpaka vanohalha inyu umalhelha ni uthama ilha ilhapo yorera yuvahilheni aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu ilha.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Vano mahuku aka o urimeelha thoko chiri aya wa attu onkhaye ahaatameria. Nansho mwaatti onkhaye va, nhochuwelha rata mmamirimani mwinyu ni mminepani mwinyu wiira wo chittu choombone chonkhaye Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu chaalhenhe aya, khiiwo ata ittu imoka ihitiminre. Chittu chonkhaye chihotimira thoko chenre aya wo ulhehani. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Nansho thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu chitimirinhe aya chittu chonkhaye choombone chaalhenhe aya uwaninyu, chiichammo anowooria uwiiherani mariro o malhiheni mwaatti onkhaye ukhuma mwiilhaponi mworera ovahilheni aya mu. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Yakhalhaka nnowuntha malhehano aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, naalhehenre aya wiira nvarecheshe, nkamwaarwaa ukaviherani milhuku chikina ni ukhoromelha, paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku anoorushiya chinene, ni inyu nnoolhakalhihiya lhakalhaka ukhuma mwiilhaponi mworera ovahilheni aya mu.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">Nayoshua anowoolhumana attu o Uisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Yamalheke, Nayoshua ahaakumaaniha attu o makosho onkhaye a attu o Uisraeli Ushekemu uwo. Nkayeehanacha ashulhupalhe, aholhelhi, attu o waamulha, ni manyaaholhelhi a attu o Uisraeli, ni ayo ahowaacha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Nayoshua nkayeerelha attu ayo wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli, aneera wiira: Khalhai vawo, manyaapwiiya inyu aakhalha ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyufrati, nkayaakavihera milhuku chikina. Ashulhupalhe amoka ari Natera, athumwanaya Aburahimu ni Nanahori. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Mii Nlhuku kahaathamiha athumwaninyu Aburahimu ukhuma wowo ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyufrati ni waawiiha Vakanaani va, waavanhe aka achishana enchi. Kahaavaha Isaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />ni Naisaka kahaavaha Yakobo ni Esau. Kaavanhe Esau miako cho Useiri wiira ikhalhe yawaya. Nansho Nayakhobo ni achishana aya ahorwaa Umisri. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Kaanyuma kahaaruma ashinna Musa ni Naharuni, nkakaakurusha mariro, ni kaanyuma nkakookumihani mwaatti wowo. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Kahaakumiha ashulhupalhe inyu ukhuma Umisri ni waawiiha mpaka ibahari yo Ushamu. Attu o Umisri ahaatwarelhelha ni nkukuta chaya ni manyaasikari o waawelha a farasi. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Attu o Uisraeli vaakulhenlhe aya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku, kahoripelhiha variyari aya, attu o Umisri ni ibahari nkayaakhunelha attu o Umisri. Mwaatti mwaashinene mwahoona kaapangenlhe aka attu o Umisri. Nkamwaakhalha uthakoni iyaakha chinchi. <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Yamalheke kahaaholhelha mpaka wi ilhapo ya Aamori aakhalha mpata nkina wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani. Nkaatakana ni inyu mwaatti, nansho mii kahouvahani machiri o waakottolha nkamwaalhakalhiha ni uvara mateeka ilhapo aya. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Ni Nabalaki anaaya Nasipori, amwene o Umoabu ni ayo ahowa ukelhelha attu o Uisraeli. Nkayaalhatulha Nabalaamu anaaya Nabeori wiira awe oolhavani mwaatti. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Nansho mii akeewelhenlhe Nabalaamu, ni ayo nkayoovahani ibarakha, ni mii nkakowookholhani mwaatti ukhuma u Nabalaki. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Yamalheke nkamwaalhapuwa mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, nkamwaaphiya Uyeriko. Attu o Uyeriko nkaatakana ni inyu mwaatti, tho attu o Uamori, o Uperizi, o Ukanaani, o Uhiti, o Ugirgashi, o Hivi ni no Uyebusi. Yayo mii kahookottolhelhani. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Kahoruma matendehu umihoolho winyu oomolhanche mamwene eelhi o Uamori. Khamwaapannge yayo wo ukusha uphanga mena miupa chinyu.<verse eid="JOS 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />“Kahoovahani imata chahaalhimilhe inyu, ni iwani a chahaathekilhe inyu nnokhalhacha inyu vano, ni ulhia maphepu o mizabibu ni o mizeituni chihaalhilhe inyu.<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />“Vano, paahi etu mwaathimicheke Apwiiya Nlhuku ni uvara mitheko chaya wo nrima wo wookwaa ni wo ukhulhuvelhiya. Nhiyeke kabisa milhuku chaathiminche aya manyaapwiiya inyu ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyufrati ni wiilhaponi Umisri. Mwaakavihereke Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Yakhalhaka khannottuna waakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi etu nthanlheke lhelho vava phi mpani nnohalha inyu unkavihera: Wiira milhuku chaathiminche aya manyaapwiiya inyu chilhe ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Uyufrati, ama milhuku cha Aamori nnokhalha inyu mwiilhaponi mwaya. Nansho mii ni inupa aka ninohalha waakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Vavawo attu nkayaakhulha yeeraka, “Khaninooria mena waahiya Apwiiya Nlhuku ni ukavihera milhuku chikina. <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu, phi nikumihilhe hii vamoka ni ashulhupalhe ihu ukhuma ilhapo yo Umisri waari ihu ipotta, nahoona wo miitho ihu mitheko cho ushangiha chaanipangenlhe aya. Nkayaaninkelha munkwahani mwihu mwonkhaye ni mmilhokoni mwa attu onkhaye o ilhapo chaavinre ihu. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaathamihacha attu onkhaye yaani Aamori onkhaye aakhalha mwiilhaponi. Paahi, ni hii ninowaakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya phi Nlhuku ihu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Nansho Nayoshua nkayeerelha, “Mwaatti khanooria waakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya yayo Atakatifu. Yayo phi Nlhuku i ihache, ni ayo nkhanouhiyererani uwonya winyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Mwaahiyaka Apwiiya Nlhuku ni ukavihera milhuku chilheto, anoutwarushani ni ulhakalhihani kabisa, inakhalhaka ahoopangelhani moombone onkhaye alha.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Ni attu ayo nkayeerelha Nayoshua wiira, “Atha mena! Hii ninowaakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku etu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Vavawo Nayoshua nkayeerelha wiira, “Mwaattiva mwaanene phi o uhimiechesha minepa chinyu wiira nhothanlha waakavihera Apwiiya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Ni ayo nkayaakhulhacha, “Hii phi o uhimiechesha.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Ni ayo nkeera, “Paahi etu nthamihacheke milhuku chinyu chilheto chirina inyu chiyo, mwaattwareke Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku a attu o Uisraeli, wo nrima winyu wonkhaye.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ni ayo, nkayeeracha, “Ninowakavihera ni waarumelhelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku ihu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Paahi, Nayoshua nkaapanga malhehano ni attu o Uisraeli Ushekemu uwo, nkaavaha ikano ni malheheriyo o utwara. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Nayoshua nkaalhepa alha onkhaye alha nhina ikitabu yo malhehero a Nlhuku; amalhiheke, ahokusha nlhuku nuulhupalhe ni weemesha wuuthi mwiri mulhupalhe u nihema na Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Yamalheke aheerelha attu onkhaye wiira, “Nna nlhuku nna phi nohalha uhimiechesha uwaninyu, ukhalhawaya niheewa malhove onkhaye anihimenrie aya Apwiiya Nlhuku. Paahi etu, ninouhimiecheshani, wiira nhiwe mwaaruna Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Kaanyuma aya Nayoshua nkaalhelha attu wiira arwaacheke, kila mmoka nkaarwaa uwannyawe.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urimeelha u Nayoshua ni Naeliazari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Baada wo yoyo mwaha uyo, Nayoshua, anaya Nanuni ni namitheko a Apwiiya Nlhuku, ahorimeelha, anari ni iyaakha imia imoka ni khumi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Ni attu ayo ahavitha unihiyeni vakittu vaamenlhe aya ukhalha vawaya, Utimnath sera, umiakoni Efraimu, mpata wo uchulhu wo mwaako wo Ugaashi.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Attu o Uisraeli ahovara mitheko cha Apwiiya Nlhuku mahuku onkhaye o ukumi u Nayoshua, ni baada yo ukhwa waya, ahothepa waakavihera mahuku onkhaye aalhokenlhe aya manyaapwiiya aya oonne wo miitho aya mitheko chaapangiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku waapangelha attu o Uisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Makhuva a Nayusufu aawihiye ni attu o Uisraeli ukhuma Umisri ahovithiya Ushekemu, vakittu vaathumme aya Nayakhobo ukhuma wa achishana a Nahamori, athumwanaya Nashekemu, wo ikipande imia imoka cho isiliva. Yeyo ilhapo iyo ni iyo nkayaakhalha ya ayari a Nayusufu.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Ni ayo Naeliazari, anaaya Naharuni, nkayaarihia ni uvithiya Ugibea, iwani yaavahye aya anaaya, Nafiniasi ilhapo yo umiakoni yo Efraimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>